# text = Nor did he trouble his borrowers with abstract calculations of figures , or references to ready-reckoners ; his simple rule of interest being all comprised in the one golden sentence which greatly simplified the accounts , and which , as a familiar precept , more easily acquired and retained in the memory than any known rule of arithmetic , cannot be too strongly recommended to the notice of capitalists , both large and small , and more especially of money-brokers and bill - discounters .
