# text = The master looked up from his papers , and the clerk calmly remained in a stationary position said Noggs , as though in explanation Noggs gave vent to his usual grunt , as much as to say and , the ring being repeated , went to the door , whence he presently returned , ushering in , by the name of Mr Bonney , a pale gentleman in a violent hurry , who , with his hair standing up in great disorder all over his head , and a very narrow white cravat tied loosely round his throat , looked as if he had been knocked up in the night and had not dressed himself since said the gentleman , taking off a white hat which was so full of papers that it would scarcely stick upon his head said Mr Ralph Nickleby , whose deliberate manner was strongly opposed to the vivacity of the other man of business echoed Mr Bonney said Mr Ralph Nickleby , smiling said Mr Bonney , slapping the capitalist familiarly on the shoulder replied Ralph , drawing on his gloves said the other carelessly continued Ralph said Mr Bonney with a meaning look replied Ralph said Mr Nickleby , calling up a charitable look
