# text = The new-comers were received with universal approbation , and Mr Bonney bustled up to the top of the table , took off his hat , ran his fingers through his hair , and knocked a hackney-coachman's knock on the table with a little hammer : whereat several gentlemen cried and nodded slightly to each other , as much as to say what spirited conduct that was .
