# text = When these symptoms had in some degree subsided , the gentlemen who were on speaking terms with Sir Matthew Pupker , or the two other members , crowded round them in three little groups , near one or other of which the gentlemen who were NOT on speaking terms with Sir Matthew Pupker or the two other members , stood lingering , and smiling , and rubbing their hands , in the desperate hope of something turning up which might bring them into notice .
