# text = All this time , Sir Matthew Pupker and the two other members were relating to their separate circles what the intentions of government were , about taking up the bill ; with a full account of what the government had said in a whisper the last time they dined with it , and how the government had been observed to wink when it said so ; from which premises they were at no loss to draw the conclusion , that if the government had one object more at heart than another , that one object was the welfare and advantage of the United Metropolitan Improved Hot Muffin and Crumpet Baking and Punctual Delivery Company .
