# text = Several very exciting skirmishes were in progress , when a loud shout attracted the attention even of the belligerents , and then there poured on to the platform , from a door at the side , a long line of gentlemen with their hats off , all looking behind them , and uttering vociferous cheers ; the cause whereof was sufficiently explained when Sir Matthew Pupker and the two other real members of Parliament came to the front , amidst deafening shouts , and testified to each other in dumb motions that they had never seen such a glorious sight as that , in the whole course of thier public career .
