# text = After announcing this determination , the honourable gentleman grew jocular ; and as patent boots , lemon-coloured kid gloves , and a fur coat collar , assist jokes materially , there was immense laughter and much cheering , and moreover such a brilliant display of ladies' pocket-handkerchiefs , as threw the grievous gentleman quite into the shade .
