# text = Mr Nickleby glanced at these frivolities with great contempt , and gave a double knock , which , having been thrice repeated , was answered by a servant girl with an uncommonly dirty face demanded Ralph sharply said the girl Mr Nickleby looked very indignant at the handmaid on being thus corrected , and demanded with much asperity what she meant ; which she was about to state , when a female voice proceeding from a perpendicular staircase at the end of the passage , inquired who was wanted said Ralph said the same voice replied the girl said the invisible female said Ralph , walking in without more parley replied the voice , as a yellow headdress bobbed over the banisters said Ralph .
