# text = A youth , who appeared a year or two older , stepped forward and saluted Ralph as his uncle growled Ralph , with an ill-favoured frown replied the youth said Ralph , imperiously said Mrs Nickleby , applying her handkerchief to her eyes returned Ralph , as he coolly unbuttoned his spencer said Nicholas , with a glance of indignation replied his uncle , taking a chair said Mrs Nickleby ; shedding tears said Ralph observed Nicholas , quietly inquired Ralph , wheeling back his chair , and surveying his nephew from head to foot with intense scorn replied the widow said Ralph replied Nicholas , his heart swelling as he spoke retorted the uncle , eyeing him contemptuously said Nicholas , flushed with anger remonstrated Mrs Nickleby urged the young lady said Ralph Mrs Nickleby made no other reply than entreating Nicholas by a gesture to keep silent ; and the uncle and nephew looked at each other for some seconds without speaking .
