# text = To tell the truth , the good lady's opinion had been not a little influenced by her brother-in-law's appeal to her better understanding , and his implied compliment to her high deserts ; and although she had dearly loved her husband , and still doted on her children , he had struck so successfully on one of those little jarring chords in the human heart ( Ralph was well acquainted with its worst weaknesses , though he knew nothing of its best ), that she had already begun seriously to consider herself the amiable and suffering victim of her late husband's imprudence Snow Hill !
