# text = Affecting not to see him , Mr Squeers feigned to be intent upon mending a pen , and offering benevolent advice to his youthful pupil said Mr Squeers observed the stranger , stopping the schoolmaster in the rehearsal of his advertisement said Mr Squeers , with an assumption of extreme surprise said the stranger added Mr Squeers With this salutation Mr Squeers patted the heads of two hollow-eyed , small-boned little boys , whom the applicant had brought with him , and waited for further communications said the stranger .
