# text = Squeers nodded in the affirmative ; his companion took another peep at the little boy on the trunk , and , turning round again , looked as if he were quite disappointed to see him so much like other boys , and said he should hardly have thought it cried Squeers replied Snawley said the schoolmaster pursued Snawley returned Squeers , throwing himself back in his chair , and waving his hand resumed Snawley said Squeers , nodding his head rejoined the other said Squeers said the father-in - law , hesitating rejoined Squeers said the father-in-law , rubbing his hands said Squeers replied the father-in-law , reciprocating the schoolmaster's grin said Squeers , taking up a pen Having entered Mr Snawley's address , the schoolmaster had next to perform the still more agreeable office of entering the receipt of the first quarter's payment in advance , which he had scarcely completed , when another voice was heard inquiring for Mr Squeers replied the schoolmaster said Ralph Nickleby , presenting himself , closely followed by Nicholas said Squeers , who had by this time got back to the box by the fire-place replied Ralph , suiting the action to the word , and placing his hat on the table before him said Squeers .
