# text = And off she did go -- if coaches be feminine -- amidst a loud flourish from the guard's horn , and the calm approval of all the judges of coaches and coach-horses congregated at the Peacock , but more especially of the helpers , who stood , with the cloths over their arms , watching the coach till it disappeared , and then lounged admiringly stablewards , bestowing various gruff encomiums on the beauty of the turn-out .
