# text = When the guard ( who was a stout old Yorkshireman ) had blown himself quite out of breath , he put the horn into a little tunnel of a basket fastened to the coach-side for the purpose , and giving himself a plentiful shower of blows on the chest and shoulders , observed it was uncommon cold ; after which , he demanded of every person separately whether he was going right through , and if not , where he WAS going .
