# text = A stage or two further on , the lamps were lighted , and a great to-do occasioned by the taking up , at a roadside inn , of a very fastidious lady with an infinite variety of cloaks and small parcels , who loudly lamented , for the behoof of the outsides , the non-arrival of her own carriage which was to have taken her on , and made the guard solemnly promise to stop every green chariot he saw coming ; which , as it was a dark night and he was sitting with his face the other way , that officer undertook , with many fervent asseverations , to do .
