# text = In fact , a man on horseback galloped down , before the passengers were well collected together ; and a careful investigation being instituted , it appeared that the lady inside had broken her lamp , and the gentleman his head ; that the two front outsides had escaped with black eyes ; the box with a bloody nose ; the coachman with a contusion on the temple ; Mr Squeers with a portmanteau bruise on his back ; and the remaining passengers without any injury at all -- thanks to the softness of the snow-drift in which they had been overturned .
