# text = This remark called up a discourse relative to the promptitude Nicholas had displayed , and he was overwhelmed with compliments and commendations observed Squeers inquired the lady who had carried the ' Davy ' or safety-lamp replied Squeers , diving into his greatcoat pocket for cards Expressing himself to this effect , Mr Squeers , who lost no opportunity of advertising gratuitously , placed his hands upon his knees , and looked at the pupils with as much benignity as he could possibly affect , while Nicholas , blushing with shame , handed round the cards as directed said the merry-faced gentleman , addressing the fastidious lady , as though he were charitably desirous to change the subject replied the lady replied the lady with strong emotion said the merry-faced gentleman , looking merrier still said the lady
