# text = And yet I hardly know how that could have been , either , because the baron's ancestor , who was an amiable man , felt very sorry afterwards for having been so rash , and laying violent hands upon a quantity of stone and timber which belonged to a weaker baron , built a chapel as an apology , and so took a receipt from Heaven , in full of all demands .
