# text = This part of the conversation was rather unintelligible ; but popular rumour in the neighbourhood asserted that Mr Squeers , being amiably opposed to cruelty to animals , not unfrequently purchased for by consumption the bodies of horned cattle who had died a natural death ; possibly he was apprehensive of having unintentionally devoured some choice morsel intended for the young gentlemen .
