# text = At length , Mr Squeers yawned fearfully , and opined that it was high time to go to bed ; upon which signal , Mrs Squeers and the girl dragged in a small straw mattress and a couple of blankets , and arranged them into a couch for Nicholas said Squeers said Mrs Squeers , pondering rejoined Squeers thought Nicholas said Squeers ; ' but I can't at this moment call to mind where it is .
