# text = He was making his fortune very fast indeed , when the faint glimmer of an expiring candle shone before his eyes , and a voice he had no difficulty in recognising as part and parcel of Mr Squeers , admonished him that it was time to rise said Mr Squeers asked Nicholas , sitting up in bed replied Squeers Nicholas needed no further admonition , but ' tumbled up ' at once , and proceeded to dress himself by the light of the taper , which Mr Squeers carried in his hand said that gentleman said Nicholas , not much interested in the intelligence replied Squeers exclaimed Nicholas rejoined Squeers tartly Offering no further observation , Nicholas huddled on his clothes .
