# text = A few words passed between them while they were thus engaged , but as their voices were partially stifled by the cupboard , all that Nicholas could distinguish was , that Mr Squeers said what Mrs Squeers had said , was injudicious , and that Mrs Squeers said what Mr Squeers said , was A vast deal of searching and rummaging ensued , and it proving fruitless , Smike was called in , and pushed by Mrs Squeers , and boxed by Mr Squeers ; which course of treatment brightening his intellects , enabled him to suggest that possibly Mrs Squeers might have the spoon in her pocket , as indeed turned out to be the case .
