# text = An unhealthy-looking boy , with warts all over his hands , stepped from his place to the master's desk , and raised his eyes imploringly to Squeers's face ; his own , quite white from the rapid beating of his heart said Squeers , speaking very slowly , for he was considering , as the saying goes , where to have him As Squeers spoke , he caught up the boy's hand by the cuff of his jacket , and surveyed it with an edifying aspect of horror and disgust demanded the schoolmaster , administering a cut with the cane to expedite the reply rejoined the boy , crying said Squeers , tucking up his wristbands , and moistening the palm of his right hand to get a good grip of the cane With this , and wholly disregarding a piteous cry for mercy , Mr Squeers fell upon the boy and caned him soundly : not leaving off , indeed , until his arm was tired out said Squeers , when he had quite done
