# text = To this circumstance may be referred , her having heard nothing of Nicholas , until Mr Squeers himself now made him the subject of conversation said Squeers , drawing up his chair inquired Mrs Squeers ; who ( as she often remarked ) was no grammarian , thank Heaven said Mrs Squeers impatiently asked Squeers retorted Mrs Squeers replied Squeers in a pacific tone rejoined Mrs Squeers Mrs Squeers , when excited , was accustomed to use strong language , and , moreover , to make use of a plurality of epithets , some of which were of a figurative kind , as the word peacock , and furthermore the allusion to Nicholas's nose , which was not intended to be taken in its literal sense , but rather to bear a latitude of construction according to the fancy of the hearers .
