# text = Neither were they meant to bear reference to each other , so much as to the object on whom they were bestowed , as will be seen in the present case : a peacock with a turned-up nose being a novelty in ornithology , and a thing not commonly seen said Squeers , as if in mild deprecation of this outbreak retorted Mrs Squeers said Squeers replied his wife urged Squeers said Mrs Squeers said Squeers , sternly said Wackford junior , suspending , in the excess of his delight , a vicious kick which he was administering to his sister replied Mr Squeers , in a sentimental voice exclaimed the interesting child , grasping his father's cane
