# text = Upon these instructions Nicholas made the pen ; when he gave it to Miss Squeers , Miss Squeers dropped it ; and when he stooped to pick it up , Miss Squeers stopped also , and they knocked their heads together ; whereat five-and-twenty little boys laughed aloud : being positively for the first and only time that half-year said Nicholas , opening the door for the young lady's retreat replied Miss Squeers said Nicholas said Miss Squeers replied Nicholas , closing the schoolroom door said Miss Squeers , as she walked away .
