# text = The ladies were in the full delight of this altered behaviour on the part of Mr Nickleby , when the expected swain arrived , with his hair very damp from recent washing , and a clean shirt , whereof the collar might have belonged to some giant ancestor , forming , together with a white waistcoat of similar dimensions , the chief ornament of his person said Miss Matilda Price ( which , by-the-bye , was the name of the miller's daughter said John with a grin that even the collar could not conceal interposed Miss Squeers , hastening to do the honours said John , who was something over six feet high , with a face and body rather above the due proportion than below it replied Nicholas , making fearful ravages on the bread and butter .
