# text = The recollection of the last teacher's leanness seemed to afford Mr Browdie the most exquisite delight , for he laughed until he found it necessary to apply his coat-cuffs to his eyes said Nicholas in a towering passion shrieked Miss Price , stopping her admirer's mouth as he was about to interrupt Weel , my lass , I dean't care aboot said the corn-factor , bestowing a hearty kiss on Miss Matilda ; ' let ' un gang on , let It now became Miss Squeers's turn to intercede with Nicholas , which she did with many symptoms of alarm and horror ; the effect of the double intercession was , that he and John Browdie shook hands across the table with much gravity ; and such was the imposing nature of the ceremonial , that Miss Squeers was overcome and shed tears said Miss Price replied Miss Squeers , sobbing said Miss Price replied Nicholas whispered Miss Price rejoined Nicholas , quite alarmed at the proposition said Miss Price , beckoning him aside , and speaking with some degree of contempt said Nicholas
