# text = No , nor I neither ," rejoined Miss Price cried Nicholas retorted Miss Price , pettishly inquired Nicholas said Miss Price -- smiling a little though , for she was pretty , and a coquette too in her small way , and Nicholas was good-looking , and she supposed him the property of somebody else , which were all reasons why she should be gratified to think she had made an impression on him Pronouncing these last words aloud , she tripped away and rejoined the big Yorkshireman .
