# text = It would have been worth a small annuity to have beheld that ; let alone Miss Price's evident joy at making them jealous , and Nicholas Nickleby's happy unconsciousness of making anybody uncomfortable said Nicholas , looking good-humouredly round the table as he took up the cards for a fresh deal tittered Miss Squeers said Nicholas said Miss Price retorted Miss Squeers , majestically said Miss Price , rallying her dear friend repeated the Yorkshireman said the Yorkshireman , striking the table heavily with his fist cried Miss Price , in affected astonishment replied the Yorkshireman , sternly .
