# text = So the means employed , and the end produced , were alike the most natural in the world ; for young ladies will look forward to being married , and will jostle each other in the race to the altar , and will avail themselves of all opportunities of displaying their own attractions to the best advantage , down to the very end of time , as they have done from its beginning exclaimed Miss Price , as if in fresh amazement said Miss Squeers , producing that change of countenance which children call making a face exclaimed Miss Price retorted Miss Squeers , making another face said Miss Price retorted Miss Squeers rejoined Miss Price Miss Squeers , in reply , turned very red , and thanked God that she hadn't got the bold faces of some people .
