# text = As he did so now , and tried to keep down the smile which parted his thin compressed lips , and puckered up the bad lines about his mouth , they both felt certain that some part , if not the whole , of their recent conversation , had been overheard said Ralph , addressing his niece , and looking contemptuously at the portrait said Miss La Creevy , with a very sprightly air cried Ralph , moving away replied Miss La Creevy , considering with the pencil end of her brush in her mouth said Ralph With an assumption of kindness which sat worse upon him even than his usual manner , Mr Ralph Nickleby motioned to the young lady to precede him , and bowing gravely to Miss La Creevy , closed the door and followed upstairs , where Mrs Nickleby received him with many expressions of regard .
