# text = It was a curious contrast to see how the timid country girl shrunk through the crowd that hurried up and down the streets , giving way to the press of people , and clinging closely to Ralph as though she feared to lose him in the throng ; and how the stern and hard - featured man of business went doggedly on , elbowing the passengers aside , and now and then exchanging a gruff salutation with some passing acquaintance , who turned to look back upon his pretty charge , with looks expressive of surprise , and seemed to wonder at the ill-assorted companionship .
