# text = Ralph relieved her from her perplexity by taking his departure without delay : Madame Mantalini making many gracious inquiries why he never came to see them ; and Mr Mantalini anathematising the stairs with great volubility as he followed them down , in the hope of inducing Kate to look round ,-- a hope , however , which was destined to remain ungratified said Ralph when they got into the street Kate was about to thank him again , but he stopped her he said replied Kate said Ralph inquired Kate said Ralph ; ' in another quarter of the town -- at the East end ; but I'll send my clerk down to you , at five o'clock on Saturday , to take you there .
