# text = Presently , the coach came ; and , after many sorrowful farewells , and a great deal of running backwards and forwards across the pavement on the part of Miss La Creevy , in the course of which the yellow turban came into violent contact with sundry foot-passengers , it ( that is to say the coach , not the turban ) went away again , with the two ladies and their luggage inside ; and Newman , despite all Mrs Nickleby's assurances that it would be his death -- on the box beside the driver .
