# text = But the notion of Ralph Nickleby having directed it to be done , tickled his fancy so much , that he could not refrain from cracking all his ten fingers in succession : at which performance Mrs Nickleby was rather startled at first , but supposing it to be in some remote manner connected with the gout , did not remark upon said Kate asked Newman rejoined Miss Nickleby said Mrs Nickleby , fumbling in her reticule for some small coin said Kate hesitating , and remarking Newman's averted face Newman Noggs , bowing to the young lady more like a gentleman than the miserable wretch he seemed , placed his hand upon his breast , and , pausing for a moment , with the air of a man who struggles to speak but is uncertain what to say , quitted the room .
