# text = Having a half-perception of what had occurred in the course of the evening , she changed her mode of making herself agreeable , and proceeded on the indirect tack said the attendant Miss Squeers sighed , and composed herself to listen continued the girl , delighted to see the impression she was making , ' Miss Price being a friend of your'n , and all ; but she do dress herself out so , and go on in such a manner to get noticed , that -- oh -- well , if people only saw themselves asked Miss Squeers , looking in her own little glass , where , like most of us , she saw -- not herself , but the reflection of some pleasant image in her own brain replied the handmaid observed Miss Squeers , with an air of abstraction said the girl sighed Miss Squeers , compassionately pursued the servant said Miss Squeers said Phoebe , for which name ' Phib ' was used as a patronising abbreviation rejoined Miss Squeers , with a stately air interposed Phib said Miss Squeers said the girl mysteriously demanded Miss Squeers replied the girl said Miss Squeers dramatically said the servant girl exclaimed Miss Squeers , clasping her hands with great dignity replied the artful Phib cried Miss Squeers replied the girl If Miss Squeers were the reason , it was very plain retorted Miss Squeers With this effusion of feeling , Miss Squeers went to bed .
