# text = This happy state of mind had some influence in bringing about a reconciliation ; for , when a knock came at the front-door next day , and the miller's daughter was announced , Miss Squeers betook herself to the parlour in a Christian frame of spirit , perfectly beautiful to behold said the miller's daughter replied Miss Squeers said Miss Price demanded Miss Squeers ; screwing up her lips , and looking as if nothing in earth , air , fire , or water , could afford her the slightest gleam of satisfaction rejoined Miss Price said Miss Squeers -- relaxing into a smile though rejoined her companion said Miss Squeers , relapsing into melancholy continued Miss Price
