# text = Indeed , the quarrel , from slight beginnings , rose to a considerable height , and was assuming a very violent complexion , when both parties , falling into a great passion of tears , exclaimed simultaneously , that they had never thought of being spoken to in that way : which exclamation , leading to a remonstrance , gradually brought on an explanation : and the upshot was , that they fell into each other's arms and vowed eternal friendship ; the occasion in question making the fifty-second time of repeating the same impressive ceremony within a twelvemonth .
