# text = The treasures of two drawers and a closet having been displayed , and all the smaller articles tried on , it was time for Miss Price to return home ; and as she had been in raptures with all the frocks , and had been stricken quite dumb with admiration of a new pink scarf , Miss Squeers said in high good humour , that she would walk part of the way with her , for the pleasure of her company ; and off they went together : Miss Squeers dilating , as they walked along , upon her father's accomplishments : and multiplying his income by ten , to give her friend some faint notion of the vast importance and superiority of her family .
