# text = It happened that that particular time , comprising the short daily interval which was suffered to elapse between what was pleasantly called the dinner of Mr Squeers's pupils , and their return to the pursuit of useful knowledge , was precisely the hour when Nicholas was accustomed to issue forth for a melancholy walk , and to brood , as he sauntered listlessly through the village , upon his miserable lot .
