# text = Here he raised up the brown bonnet , and regarding with most unfeigned astonishment a look of tender reproach from Miss Squeers , shrunk back a few paces to be out of the reach of the fair burden , and went on to say exclaimed Miss Price as Nicholas paused stammered Nicholas with a half - smile , and looking towards Miss Squeers thought Miss Squeers she whispered to her friend rejoined Miss Price exclaimed Nicholas with such energy of utterance as might have been , for the moment , mistaken for rapture replied Miss Price said the blushing Miss Squeers in soft accents cried Nicholas hurriedly With this particularly plain and straightforward declaration , which he made with all the vehemence that his indignant and excited feelings could bring to bear upon it , Nicholas waiting to hear no more , retreated .
