# text = However , he had thought proper to do otherwise , and Miss Squeers was outrageous said the irritated young lady , when she had regained her own room , and eased her mind by committing an assault on Phib It was scarcely necessary to do this , but Miss Squeers was as good as her word ; and poor Nicholas , in addition to bad food , dirty lodging , and the being compelled to witness one dull unvarying round of squalid misery , was treated with every special indignity that malice could suggest , or the most grasping cupidity put upon him .
