# text = It was the anniversary of that happy day on which the Church of England as by law established , had bestowed Mrs Kenwigs upon Mr Kenwigs ; and in grateful commemoration of the same , Mrs Kenwigs had invited a few select friends to cards and a supper in the first floor , and had put on a new gown to receive them in : which gown , being of a flaming colour and made upon a juvenile principle , was so successful that Mr Kenwigs said the eight years of matrimony and the five children seemed all a dream , and Mrs Kenwigs younger and more blooming than on the very first Sunday he had kept company with her .
