# text = Beautiful as Mrs Kenwigs looked when she was dressed though , and so stately that you would have supposed she had a cook and housemaid at least , and nothing to do but order them about , she had a world of trouble with the preparations ; more , indeed , than she , being of a delicate and genteel constitution , could have sustained , had not the pride of housewifery upheld her .
