# text = There were also an elderly lady from the back-parlour , and one more young lady , who , next to the collector , perhaps was the great lion of the party , being the daughter of a theatrical fireman , who ' went on ' in the pantomime , and had the greatest turn for the stage that was ever known , being able to sing and recite in a manner that brought the tears into Mrs Kenwigs's eyes .
