# text = There was only one drawback upon the pleasure of seeing such friends , and that was , that the lady in the back-parlour , who was very fat , and turned of sixty , came in a low book-muslin dress and short kid gloves , which so exasperated Mrs Kenwigs , that that lady assured her visitors , in private , that if it hadn't happened that the supper was cooking at the back-parlour grate at that moment , she certainly would have requested its representative to withdraw said Mr Kenwigs returned his wife said Kenwigs said Mrs Kenwigs , turning to the other married lady cried the married lady replied Mrs Kenwigs said Kenwigs observed the bachelor friend , intending a joke said Mr Kenwigs , solemnly said the friend , abashed rejoined Mr Kenwigs Mr Kenwigs was going to say but he rounded the sentence with ' apartments' .
