# text = This reflection was echoed by all present , who said first , and afterwards tittered Mrs Kenwigs said the collector added everybody said Mr Lillyvick , surveying his audience with a grave air interposed Mrs Kenwigs said the collector , firmly replied Mrs Kenwigs , submissively retorted Mr Lillyvick A general exclamation of astonishment burst from the company repeated Mr Lillyvick , regarding them with a rigid look replied that gentleman , in no way displeased at the reminiscence , inasmuch as it proved , beyond all doubt , what a high family Mrs Kenwigs came of said Mr Lillyvick A gentle murmur seemed to say , that , in one of Mr Lillyvick's station , the objection was not only natural , but highly praiseworthy said Mr Lillyvick said Mr Kenwigs rejoined Mr Lillyvick said Kenwigs remarked Mr Lillyvick cried her mother , at this crisis , much affected
