# text = The ecstasies consequent upon the effort had not yet subsided , and Newman ( who had not been thoroughly sober at so late an hour for a long long time ,) had not yet been able to put in a word of announcement , that the punch was ready , when a hasty knock was heard at the room-door , which elicited a shriek from Mrs Kenwigs , who immediately divined that the baby had fallen out of bed demanded Mr Kenwigs , sharply said Crowl , looking in , in his nightcap cried Newman , much astonished replied Crowl , who was not best pleased at the prospect of losing his fire said Newman , rising rejoined Crowl asked Newman replied Crowl Newman reflected for a few seconds , and then hurried away , muttering that he would be back directly .
