# text = In the present instance , the pantomime consisted of a nod , and not a shake ; so Nicholas took the answer as a favourable one said Nicholas , laying his hand on Newman's shoulder Newman opened and shut his mouth , several times , as though he were trying his utmost to speak , but could make nothing of it , and finally fixed his eyes on Nicholas with a grim and ghastly stare urged Nicholas , colouring said Newman urged Nicholas replied Newman answered Nicholas , impatiently said Newman , hesitating rejoined Nicholas With this gentle allusion to the absent Mr Squeers , Nicholas repressed his rising wrath , and relating to Newman exactly what had passed at Dotheboys Hall , entreated him to speak out without more pressing .
