# text = Meanwhile , the company below stairs , after listening attentively and not hearing any noise which would justify them in interfering for the gratification of their curiosity , returned to the chamber of the Kenwigses , and employed themselves in hazarding a great variety of conjectures relative to the cause of Mr Noggs' sudden disappearance and detention said Mrs Kenwigs said Mr Kenwigs said Mr Lillyvick , in a loud voice asked Mr Kenwigs , with becoming submission to the collector of water-rates replied Mr Lillyvick , angrily Here was an untoward event !
