# text = He was not quite so certain of the callings and stations of two smart young ladies who were in conversation with the fat lady before the fire , until -- having sat himself down in a corner , and remarked that he would wait until the other customers had been served -- the fat lady resumed the dialogue which his entrance had interrupted said the fat lady , still airing herself as aforesaid said Tom , turning over some leaves of the ledger said the fat lady interposed a genteel female , in shepherd's-plaid boots , who appeared to be the client said Tom , reading tittered the client said Tom interrupted the client said Tom , impressively asked the client in an altered tone replied Tom said the client remarked Tom , turning over the leaves said the client , after a little whispering with her friend Tom made out the address , as requested , and the genteel client , having satisfied the fat lady with a small fee , meanwhile , went away accompanied by her friend .
