# text = Tom made no other reply than thrusting his tongue into his cheek , and pointing the feather of his pen towards Nicholas -- reminders which elicited from the fat lady an inquiry , of Nicholas briefly replied , that he wanted to know whether there was any such post to be had , as secretary or amanuensis to a gentleman rejoined the mistress answered that young gentleman ; and as he said it , he winked towards Nicholas , with a degree of familiarity which he , no doubt , intended for a rather flattering compliment , but with which Nicholas was most ungratefully disgusted .
