# text = Mr Gregsbury reflected , blew his nose , threw himself further back in his chair , came forward again , leaning his elbows on the table , made a triangle with his two thumbs and his two forefingers , and tapping his nose with the apex thereof , replied ( smiling as he said it At this unexpected answer , a hoarse murmur arose from the deputation ; and the same gentleman who had expressed an opinion relative to the gammoning nature of the introductory speech , again made a monosyllabic demonstration , by growling out Which growl being taken up by his fellows , swelled into a very earnest and general remonstrance said Mr Pugstyles , with a distant bow To this , Mr Gregsbury read the following reply , which , anticipating the request , he had composed in the form of a letter , whereof copies had been made to send round to the newspapers .
