# text = Nicholas replied in the affirmative said Mr Gregsbury rejoined Nicholas ,-- politely enough , but quite at his ease said Mr Gregsbury Nicholas related how he had been forced up by the deputation said Mr Gregsbury Nicholas took a chair , and Mr Gregsbury stared at him for a long time , as if to make certain , before he asked any further questions , that there were no objections to his outward appearance he said at length replied Nicholas said Mr Gregsbury replied Nicholas , smiling inquired Mr Gregsbury replied Nicholas retorted the member , looking shrewdly at him , with his head on one side said Nicholas , considering interposed Mr Gregsbury said Nicholas , with a half-smile rejoined Mr Gregsbury said Nicholas , after a moment's reflection Mr Gregsbury looked fixedly at Nicholas for a short time , and then glancing warily round the room , said in a suppressed voice interposed Nicholas , doubtful whether he had heard aright repeated Mr Gregsbury said Nicholas replied Mr Gregsbury with a solemn aspect replied Nicholas said Mr Gregsbury Nicholas bowed continued Mr Gregsbury said Nicholas continued Mr Gregsbury , warming replied Nicholas said Mr Gregsbury with any other little eulogium that might strike you at the moment .
