# text = In truth , for our own part , we are disposed to look upon such gentleman as being rather incumbrances than otherwise in rising families : happening to be acquainted with several whose spirit prevents their settling down to any grovelling occupation , and only displays itself in a tendency to cultivate moustachios , and look fierce ; and although moustachios and ferocity are both very pretty things in their way , and very much to be commended , we confess to a desire to see them bred at the owner's proper cost , rather than at the expense of low-spirited people .
