# text = Nicholas , therefore , not being a high-spirited young man according to common parlance , and deeming it a greater degradation to borrow , for the supply of his necessities , from Newman Noggs , than to teach French to the little Kenwigses for five shillings a week , accepted the offer with the alacrity already described , and betook himself to the first floor with all convenient speed .
