# text = At this early hour many sickly girls , whose business , like that of the poor worm , is to produce , with patient toil , the finery that bedecks the thoughtless and luxurious , traverse our streets , making towards the scene of their daily labour , and catching , as if by stealth , in their hurried walk , the only gasp of wholesome air and glimpse of sunlight which cheer their monotonous existence during the long train of hours that make a working day .
