# text = My dear asked Kate replied the man , holding the door in his hand , and honouring the inquirer with a stare and a broad grin said Kate said the footman , touching the handle of one in the door-post replied Kate said the man Cautioning her , in these terms , not to trip over a heterogeneous litter of pastry-cook's trays , lamps , waiters full of glasses , and piles of rout seats which were strewn about the hall , plainly bespeaking a late party on the previous night , the man led the way to the second story , and ushered Kate into a back-room , communicating by folding-doors with the apartment in which she had first seen the mistress of the establishment said the man Having made this promise with much affability , he retired and left Kate alone .
