# text = And then , there was a sound as though Mr Mantalini were sipping his coffee returned Madame Mantalini , evidently pouting said Mr Mantalini returned Madame , with a sob said Mr Mantalini , breaking an egg rejoined Madame , sulkily retorted Mr Mantalini , with his egg-spoon in his mouth said Mrs Mantalini replied Mr Mantalini said Madame Mantalini , apparently desirous to lead the conversation back to the point from which it had strayed said Madame cried Mantalini , in a sort of lazy rapture resumed Madame said Mantalini ; who , by the altered sound of his voice , seemed to have moved his chair , and taken up his position nearer to his wife interposed Madame cried Mantalini asked Madame , playfully replied her husband Mr Mantalini did not finish the sentence , but he gave Madame Mantalini a very loud kiss , which Madame Mantalini returned ; after which , there seemed to be some more kissing mixed up with the progress of the breakfast said Mantalini , when these endearments ceased replied Madame said Mantalini said Madame coaxingly returned her husband cried Madame replied Mantalini Madame Mantalini's prudence , if she had any , was not proof against these triumphal pictures ; after a little jingling of keys , she observed that she would see what her desk contained , and rising for that purpose , opened the folding-door , and walked into the room where Kate was seated exclaimed Madame Mantalini , recoiling in surprise cried Mantalini , hurrying in said Kate , addressing Madame Mantalini said Madame , turning to her husband said her husband cried Madame said Mantalini , kissing his wife's hand , and grimacing aside , to Miss Nickleby , who turned away .
