# text = It may be further remarked , that Miss Knag still aimed at youth , although she had shot beyond it , years ago ; and that she was weak and vain , and one of those people who are best described by the axiom , that you may trust them as far as you can see them , and no farther said Madame Mantalini Miss Knag of course replied , that to forget anything Madame Mantalini had directed , was a moral impossibility ; and that lady , dispensing a general good-morning among her assistants , sailed away said Miss Knag , rubbing her hands together said Kate inquired Miss Knag replied Kate cried Miss Knag , elevating her hands replied Kate , laying aside her bonnet asked one of the young ladies replied Kate inquired another answered Kate interposed Miss Knag
