# text = In this manner they walked on , very amicably , until they arrived at Miss Knag's brother's , who was an ornamental stationer and small circulating library keeper , in a by-street off Tottenham Court Road ; and who let out by the day , week , month , or year , the newest old novels , whereof the titles were displayed in pen-and-ink characters on a sheet of pasteboard , swinging at his door-post .
