# text = To judge from all appearances , and the difficulty of making the water warm , the last servant could not have been much accustomed to any other fire than St Anthony's ; but a little brandy and water was made at last , and the guests , having been previously regaled with cold leg of mutton and bread and cheese , soon afterwards took leave ; Kate amusing herself , all the way home , with the recollection of her last glimpse of Mr Mortimer Knag deeply abstracted in the shop ; and Mrs Nickleby by debating within herself whether the dressmaking firm would ultimately become ' Mantalini , Knag , and Nickleby ', or ' Mantalini , Nickleby , and Knag '.
