# text = It happened that an old lord of great family , who was going to marry a young lady of no family in particular , came with the young lady , and the young lady's sister , to witness the ceremony of trying on two nuptial bonnets which had been ordered the day before , and Madame Mantalini announcing the fact , in a shrill treble , through the speaking-pipe , which communicated with the workroom , Miss Knag darted hastily upstairs with a bonnet in each hand , and presented herself in the show-room , in a charming state of palpitation , intended to demonstrate her enthusiasm in the cause .
