# text = But , pending the salutation , Miss Knag , who was tinged with curiosity , stepped accidentally behind the glass , and encountered the lively young lady's eye just at the very moment when she kissed the old lord ; upon which the young lady , in a pouting manner , murmured something about and and finished by darting a look of displeasure at Miss Knag , and smiling contemptuously said the young lady said Madame Mantalini said the sister said the lord's intended , throwing herself languidly on a sofa said the old lord said the young lady , in the same careless manner replied Madame Mantalini asked Miss Knag , trembling repeated the superior , sharply .
