# text = As he did so , he glanced warily round as though to assure himself of the impression which her unlooked-for appearance had created said Lord Frederick Verisopht , taking his glass out of his right eye , where it had , until now , done duty on Kate , and fixing it in his left , to bring it to bear on Ralph said Mr Pluck said his lordship said Sir Mulberry Hawk , in a thick coarse voice Sir Mulberry garnished this speech with a hoarse laugh , and terminated it with a pleasant oath regarding Mr Nickleby's limbs , whereat Messrs Pyke and Pluck laughed consumedly .
