# text = The fashionable vagabond for the moment quite quailed under the steady look of the older sinner , and walked towards the door , muttering as he went he said , stopping short when he reached the door , as if a new light had broken in upon him , and confronting Ralph again Ralph smiled again , but made no answer pursued Sir Mulberry said Ralph retorted the other Although this hurried dialogue was carried on in a suppressed tone on both sides , Ralph looked involuntarily round to ascertain that Kate had not moved her position so as to be within hearing .
