# text = Ralph Nickleby , who was proof against all appeals of blood and kindred -- who was steeled against every tale of sorrow and distress -- staggered while he looked , and went back into his house , as a man who had seen a spirit from some world beyond the grave Little Miss La Creevy trotted briskly through divers streets at the west end of the town , early on Monday morning -- the day after the dinner -- charged with the important commission of acquainting Madame Mantalini that Miss Nickleby was too unwell to attend that day , but hoped to be enabled to resume her duties on the morrow .
