# text = She stopped here ; for there was so much heart in her altered tone and manner , that Nicholas was quite moved he said , after a short silence exclaimed Miss La Creevy answered Nicholas , with a more sprightly air interposed Miss La Creevy said Nicholas rejoined Miss La Creevy said Nicholas asked Miss La Creevy replied Nicholas said Miss La Creevy pursued Nicholas said Miss La Creevy , rubbing her hands she added rejoined Nicholas said Miss La Creevy answered Nicholas said Miss La Creevy Talking on very fast and very much , Miss La Creevy finished her breakfast with great expedition , put away the tea-caddy and hid the key under the fender , resumed her bonnet , and , taking Nicholas's arm , sallied forth at once to the city .
