# text = The poppet , however , encouraged perhaps by the relenting tone of this reply , ventured to rebel , and , stealing into the room , made towards Madame Mantalini on tiptoe , blowing her a kiss as he came along said Mantalini , putting his left arm round the waist of his life and soul , and drawing her towards him with his right replied his wife exclaimed Mantalini Mr Mantalini stroked his chin , as he said this , and glanced complacently at an opposite mirror reasoned his wife , in a low tone said Mantalini urged Madame rejoined Mr Mantalini interposed Madame Mr Mantalini , who , in his eagerness to make up matters with his wife , had overlooked , or feigned to overlook , Miss Nickleby hitherto , took the hint , and laying his finger on his lip , sunk his voice still lower .
