# text = There was , then , a great deal of whispering , during which Madame Mantalini appeared to make reference , more than once , to certain debts incurred by Mr Mantalini previous to her coverture ; and also to an unexpected outlay of money in payment of the aforesaid debts ; and furthermore , to certain agreeable weaknesses on that gentleman's part , such as gaming , wasting , idling , and a tendency to horse-flesh ; each of which matters of accusation Mr Mantalini disposed of , by one kiss or more , as its relative importance demanded .
