# text = Kate busied herself in what she had to do , and was silently arranging the various articles of decoration in the best taste she could display , when she started to hear a strange man's voice in the room , and started again , to observe , on looking round , that a white hat , and a red neckerchief , and a broad round face , and a large head , and part of a green coat were in the room too said the proprietor of these appearances rejoined Kate , greatly astonished
