# text = The professional gentlemen , however , were not at all discomposed by this event , for Mr Scaley , leaning upon a stand on which a handsome dress was displayed ( so that his shoulders appeared above it , in nearly the same manner as the shoulders of the lady for whom it was designed would have done if she had had it on ), pushed his hat on one side and scratched his head with perfect unconcern , while his friend Mr Tix , taking that opportunity for a general survey of the apartment preparatory to entering on business , stood with his inventory-book under his arm and his hat in his hand , mentally occupied in putting a price upon every object within his range of vision .
