# text = Now , in the ordinary course of things , and according to all authentic descriptions of high life , as set forth in books , Mrs Wititterly ought to have been in her BOUDOIR ; but whether it was that Mr Wititterly was at that moment shaving himself in the BOUDOIR or what not , certain it is that Mrs Wititterly gave audience in the drawing-room , where was everything proper and necessary , including curtains and furniture coverings of a roseate hue , to shed a delicate bloom on Mrs Wititterly's complexion , and a little dog to snap at strangers' legs for Mrs Wititterly's amusement , and the afore-mentioned page , to hand chocolate for Mrs Wititterly's refreshment .
