# text = The page disappeared on this errand , and after a short interval , during which not a word was spoken on either side , opened the door for an important gentleman of about eight-and-thirty , of rather plebeian countenance , and with a very light head of hair , who leant over Mrs Wititterly for a little time , and conversed with her in whispers he said , turning round interposed Mrs Wititterly said Mr W ., blowing an imaginary feather away
