# text = The lady sighed said Mr Wititterly Here Mr Wititterly , who , in the ardour of his description , had flourished his right hand to within something less than an inch of Mrs Nickleby's bonnet , drew it hastily back again , and blew his nose as fiercely as if it had been done by some violent machinery said Mrs Wititterly , with a faint smile said Mr W said Mrs Wititterly rejoined her husband Here , both Mr and Mrs Wititterly , who had talked rather at the Nicklebys than to each other , left off speaking , and looked at their two hearers , with an expression of countenance which seemed to say said her husband , addressing himself to Mrs Nickleby interposed Mrs Wititterly said Mr Wititterly said the lady replied Mr Wititterly
