# text = Before reaching home , she had freed Mrs Wititterly's soul from all bodily restraint ; married Kate with great splendour at St George's , Hanover Square ; and only left undecided the minor question , whether a splendid French-polished mahogany bedstead should be erected for herself in the two-pair back of the house in Cadogan Place , or in the three-pair front : between which apartments she could not quite balance the advantages , and therefore adjusted the question at last , by determining to leave it to the decision of her son-in-law .
