# text = Having pleaded ineffectually first for another half-mile , and afterwards for another quarter , Newman was fain to comply , and to shape his course towards Golden Square , after interchanging many hearty and affectionate farewells , and many times turning back to wave his hat to the two wayfarers when they had become mere specks in the distance said Nicholas , as they trudged with stout hearts onwards Smike nodded his head and smiled , but expressed no other emotion ; for whether they had been bound for Portsmouth or Port Royal would have been alike to him , so they had been bound together resumed Nicholas replied Smike said Nicholas resumed Smike ; his eyes sparkling at the prospect of displaying his abilities said Nicholas , gravely said Smike , brightening up again rejoined Nicholas asked Smike , after a short silence said Nicholas , with a good-humoured smile rejoined Smike , falling back a few steps asked Nicholas said Smike rejoined Nicholas he added , looking him steadily in the face said Smike , shaking his head sorrowfully asked Nicholas , turning quickly upon him as though the answer in some way helped out the purport of his question said Smike said Nicholas , touching him on the arm replied his companion , with a vacant look He shivered involuntarily as he spoke retorted Nicholas , fixing his eyes full upon that of his companion , which was fast settling into an unmeaning stupefied gaze , once habitual to him , and common even then cried the lad said Nicholas quietly replied the boy repeated Nicholas , with assumed carelessness said Smike remarked Nicholas rejoined Smike said Nicholas , wishing to attract his full attention said the poor creature , shaking his head rejoined the youth , with a melancholy look asked Nicholas , abruptly changing the theme said Smike He quickened his pace as he said this , apparently under the impression that they had been standing still during the whole of the previous dialogue .
