# text = They passed a great many bills , pasted against the walls and displayed in windows , wherein the names of Mr Vincent Crummles , Mrs Vincent Crummles , Master Crummles , Master P . Crummles , and Miss Crummles , were printed in very large letters , and everything else in very small ones ; and , turning at length into an entry , in which was a strong smell of orange-peel and lamp-oil , with an under-current of sawdust , groped their way through a dark passage , and , descending a step or two , threaded a little maze of canvas screens and paint pots , and emerged upon the stage of the Portsmouth Theatre said Mr Crummles .
