# text = A pretty general muster of the company had by this time taken place ; for besides Mr Lenville and his friend Tommy , there were present , a slim young gentleman with weak eyes , who played the low-spirited lovers and sang tenor songs , and who had come arm-in-arm with the comic countryman -- a man with a turned-up nose , large mouth , broad face , and staring eyes .
