# text = Lastly , there was Mrs Grudden in a brown cloth pelisse and a beaver bonnet , who assisted Mrs Crummles in her domestic affairs , and took money at the doors , and dressed the ladies , and swept the house , and held the prompt book when everybody else was on for the last scene , and acted any kind of part on any emergency without ever learning it , and was put down in the bills under my name or names whatever , that occurred to Mr Crummles as looking well in print .
