# text = Whereupon , she became charmingly confused , and , pulling out her pocket-handkerchief from a faded pink silk reticule with a gilt clasp , called to Miss Ledrook said Miss Snevellicci said Miss Ledrook But Miss Ledrook wouldn't come to Miss Snevellicci , so Miss Snevellicci was obliged to go to Miss Ledrook , which she did , in a skipping manner that was quite fascinating ; and Miss Ledrook evidently joked Miss Snevellicci about being struck with Nicholas ; for , after some playful whispering , Miss Snevellicci hit Miss Ledrook very hard on the backs of her hands , and retired up , in a state of pleasing confusion said Mr Vincent Crummles , who had been writing on a piece of paper repeated Mrs Grudden , looking about her said Mr Crummles said Nicholas , starting repeated Mr Crummles , raising his voice , to drown the unfortunate Mr Johnson's remonstrance
