# text = This outlaw's wife was , somehow or other , mixed up with a patriarch , living in a castle a long way off , and this patriarch was the father of several of the characters , but he didn't exactly know which , and was uncertain whether he had brought up the right ones in his castle , or the wrong ones ; he rather inclined to the latter opinion , and , being uneasy , relieved his mind with a banquet , during which solemnity somebody in a cloak said which somebody was known by nobody ( except the audience ) to be the outlaw himself , who had come there , for reasons unexplained , but possibly with an eye to the spoons .
