# text = Mr Crummles was very red and hot , for your outlaws are desperate fellows to shout replied Nicholas said Mr Crummles asked Nicholas said Mr Crummles replied Nicholas said Mr . Crummles said Nicholas returned Mr Crummles replied Nicholas pursued Mr Crummles said Nicholas said Crummles , sitting himself down on a drum , and taking a great pinch of snuff , as he looked him steadily in the face rejoined Nicholas murmured the manager in a persuasive tone said Nicholas , with an air of very strong objection said Mr Crummles replied Nicholas inquired a voice close to his ear ; and , looking round , he found Mrs Crummles and Miss Snevellicci herself standing behind him replied Mr Crummles , looking at Nicholas exclaimed Mrs Crummles cried Miss Snevellicci said Mrs Crummles said Mr Crummles , smiling added Mrs Crummles , in her accustomed tragedy tones said Nicholas , moved by these appeals Miss Snevellicci was at once overwhelmed with blushes and expressions of gratitude , of which latter commodity neither Mr nor Mrs Crummles was by any means sparing .
