# text = Nicholas had read a great many of these scraps , and was absorbed in a circumstantial and melancholy account of the train of events which had led to Miss Snevellicci's spraining her ankle by slipping on a piece of orange-peel flung by a monster in human form , ( so the paper said ,) upon the stage at Winchester ,-- when that young lady herself , attired in the coal-scuttle bonnet and walking-dress complete , tripped into the room , with a thousand apologies for having detained him so long after the appointed time said Miss Snevellicci returned Nicholas said Miss Snevellicci , buttoning her glove in much confusion rejoined Nicholas , laying his hand upon the scrapbook said Miss Snevellicci , seizing the book and putting it away in a closet said Nicholas .
