# text = He had likewise proved , that by altering the received mode of punctuation , any one of Shakespeare's plays could be made quite different , and the sense completely changed ; it is needless to say , therefore , that he was a great critic , and a very profound and most original thinker said Mrs Curdle , entering the parlour Miss Snevellicci made a graceful obeisance , and hoped Mrs Curdle was well , as also Mr Curdle , who at the same time appeared .
