# text = This was addressed to a young gentleman who was pinching the phenomenon behind , apparently with a view of ascertaining whether she was real said the mama , turning to Miss Snevellicci Miss Lane was the governess , and this entreaty was rendered necessary by the abrupt behaviour of the youngest Miss Borum , who , having filched the phenomenon's little green parasol , was now carrying it bodily off , while the distracted infant looked helplessly on said good - natured Mrs Borum , turning again to Miss Snevellicci said Miss Snevellicci cried Mrs Borum
