# text = But , in this latter respect he was mistaken ; for -- whether Mr Vincent Crummles had paved the way , or Miss Petowker had some special reason for treating him with even more than her usual amiability -- their meeting at the theatre next day was more like that of two dear friends who had been inseparable from infancy , than a recognition passing between a lady and gentleman who had only met some half - dozen times , and then by mere chance .
