# text = Nicholas looked good-humouredly at Smike , who , taking the hint , disappeared said Mr Lillyvick asked Nicholas rejoined the collector thought Nicholas said Mr Lillyvick replied Nicholas resumed Mr Lillyvick said Mr Lillyvick , snapping his fingers asked Nicholas replied the collector replied Nicholas retorted the collector , patting him benignantly on the side of the head with his umbrella suggested Nicholas replied the collector said Nicholas replied the collector , buttoning his waistcoat observed Nicholas replied Mr Lillyvick , shaking his head nervously asked Nicholas replied the collector of water-rate said Nicholas rejoined Mr Lillyvick said the collector , quite trembling as he spoke said Nicholas said Mr Lillyvick said the collector , highly anxious to prevent any misunderstanding on this point replied Nicholas said the collector said Nicholas said Nicholas said the collector , with a rueful face replied Nicholas , with an awkward attempt to convert a laugh into a cough groaned the collector cried Nicholas replied the collector , rising replied Nicholas said the collector rejoined Nicholas said the collector With these words , Mr Lillyvick , whose manner had exhibited through the whole of this interview a most extraordinary compound of precipitation , hesitation , confidence and doubt , fondness , misgiving , meanness , and self-importance , turned his back upon the room , and left Nicholas to enjoy a laugh by himself if he felt so disposed .
