# text = Without stopping to inquire whether the intervening day appeared to Nicholas to consist of the usual number of hours of the ordinary length , it may be remarked that , to the parties more directly interested in the forthcoming ceremony , it passed with great rapidity , insomuch that when Miss Petowker awoke on the succeeding morning in the chamber of Miss Snevellicci , she declared that nothing should ever persuade her that that really was the day which was to behold a change in her condition said Miss Petowker
