# text = By the combined exertions of these young gentlemen and the bridesmaids , assisted by the coachman , Miss Petowker was at length supported in a condition of much exhaustion to the first floor , where she no sooner encountered the youthful bridegroom than she fainted with great decorum said the collector Miss Petowker grasped the collector's hand , but emotion choked her utterance said the collector rejoined the bride With such expressions of sorrow , Miss Petowker went on to enumerate the dear friends of her youthful days one by one , and to call upon such of them as were present to come and embrace her .
