# text = To this act of desertion he was led , not only by his own inclinations , but by his anxiety on account of Smike , who , having to sustain the character of the Apothecary , had been as yet wholly unable to get any more of the part into his head than the general idea that he was very hungry , which -- perhaps from old recollections -- he had acquired with great aptitude said Nicholas , laying down the book said Smike , shaking his head inquired Nicholas said Smike exclaimed Nicholas . ' Well said .
