# text = But Lord Frederick Verisopht was both , and took them to be complimentary he said Ralph began in his usual tones cried the other , achieving the great point of his lesson to a miracle said Ralph , looking sharply at him replied the client thought Ralph pursued the client said Ralph , rubbing his hands slowly over each other replied Verisopht replied Ralph Ralph ran over this brief summary of Kate's condition as if it were merely passing through his own mind , and he had no intention to speak aloud ; but the shrewd sly look which he directed at his companion as he delivered it , gave this poor assumption the lie cried his client said Ralph , with feigned reluctance Ralph pointed to the adjoining room as he spoke , and nodded expressively .
