# text = It was , indeed , that well-intentioned lady , who , having received an offer for the empty house in the city directed to the landlord , had brought it post-haste to Mr Nickleby without delay said Ralph cried Sir Mulberry Hawk , advancing to the astonished lady said Sir Mulberry , stopping short said Mrs Nickleby , acknowledging the compliment with a graceful bend cried Sir Mulberry , turning to his friend thought Mrs Nickleby said Sir Mulberry Ralph did so , in a kind of desperation .
