# text = As she was carried away for the moment by an irresistible train of thought , all connected with her daughter's future greatness , Sir Mulberry Hawk and his friend exchanged glances over the top of the bonnet which the poor lady so much regretted not having left at home , and proceeded to dilate with great rapture , but much respect on the manifold perfections of Miss Nickleby said Sir Mulberry , throwing into his voice an indication of the warmest feeling replied Mrs Nickleby said Lord Verisopht , with the air of a judge of cleverness returned Mrs Nickleby said Mrs Nickleby added Mrs Nickleby With similar recollections Mrs Nickleby beguiled the tediousness of the way , until they reached the omnibus , which the extreme politeness of her new friends would not allow them to leave until it actually started , when they took their hats , as Mrs Nickleby solemnly assured her hearers on many subsequent occasions and kissed their straw-coloured kid gloves till they were no longer visible .
