# text = At the theatre entrance there was more banging and more bustle , and there were also Messrs Pyke and Pluck waiting to escort her to her box ; and so polite were they , that Mr Pyke threatened with many oaths to ' smifligate ' a very old man with a lantern who accidentally stumbled in her way -- to the great terror of Mrs Nickleby , who , conjecturing more from Mr Pyke's excitement than any previous acquaintance with the etymology of the word that smifligation and bloodshed must be in the main one and the same thing , was alarmed beyond expression , lest something should occur .
