# text = The new party beginning to converse together , Sir Mulberry suddenly assumed the character of a most attentive listener , and implored his friends not to breathe -- not to breathe said Mrs Nickleby replied Sir Mulberry , laying his hand on her arm cried Miss Nickleby's mama , thrusting her head round the curtain said Kate , shrinking back as she caught sight of a man smiling and kissing his hand replied Mrs Nickleby , bending towards Mrs Wititterly , and speaking a little louder for that lady's edification thought Kate hurriedly Now , Kate thought thus SO hurriedly , and the surprise was so great , and moreover brought back so forcibly the recollection of what had passed at Ralph's delectable dinner , that she turned extremely pale and appeared greatly agitated , which symptoms being observed by Mrs Nickleby , were at once set down by that acute lady as being caused and occasioned by violent love .
