# text = As there appeared to be some doubt in the mind of his patron how he could best join in this conversation , the indefatigable Mr Pyke threw himself into the breach , and , by way of saying something to the point , inquired -- with reference to the aforesaid medicine -- whether it was nice said Mr W observed Pyke , with a complimentary bow said Mrs Wititterly , smiling replied her husband , in a tone which seemed to say that he was not vain , but still must insist upon their privileges added Mr Wititterly , wheeling round to the nobleman Pyke and Pluck promptly remarked that certainly nothing could be fairer than that ; and the call having been by this time protracted to a very great length , they obeyed Sir Mulberry's look , and rose to go .
