# text = But allusion being made to her being held in disregard by the gentlemen , she evinced violent emotion , and this blow was no sooner followed up by the remark concerning her seniority , than she fell back upon the sofa , uttering dismal screams cried Mr Wititterly , bouncing into the room But Julia looked down most perseveringly , and screamed still louder ; so Mr Wititterly rang the bell , and danced in a frenzied manner round the sofa on which Mrs Wititterly lay ; uttering perpetual cries for Sir Tumley Snuffim , and never once leaving off to ask for any explanation of the scene before him cried Mr Wititterly , menacing the page with both fists he said , looking round with an air of melancholy triumph With this assurance Mr Wititterly took up the prostrate form of Mrs Wititterly , and carried her bodily off to bed .
