# text = He hastily put away a padlocked cash-box that was on the table , and substituted in its stead an empty purse said Ralph Newman , with a grim smile at this manoeuvre , beckoned the young lady to advance , and having placed a chair for her , retired ; looking stealthily over his shoulder at Ralph as he limped slowly out said Ralph , roughly enough ; but still with something more of kindness in his manner than he would have exhibited towards anybody else Kate raised her eyes , which were filled with tears ; and with an effort to master her emotion strove to speak , but in vain .
