# text = But she met his gaze proudly and firmly , and although her face was very pale , it looked more noble and handsome , lighted up as it was , than it had ever appeared before said Ralph , speaking in his harshest tones , as something in the flashing eye reminded him of Nicholas at their last meeting replied Kate demanded Ralph , sharply replied Kate , colouring deeply said Kate , hurrying to the old man , and laying her arm upon his shoulder Ralph looked at her for an instant ; then turned away his head , and beat his foot nervously upon the ground said Kate , bending over him , and timidly placing her little hand in his said Ralph , rising from his chair , and pacing up and down the room in his old attitude rejoined Kate , emphatically said Ralph , suddenly turning said Ralph , coming to a dead stop , and clasping his hands more tightly behind him Kate fell back a step or two , and looked at him , as if in doubt whether she had heard aright said Ralph , poising himself alternately on his toes and heels , and looking coolly in his niece's face cried Kate rejoined Ralph , raising his forefinger interrupted Kate , with becoming pride and indignation With these words , she waved her hand , and quitted the room , leaving Ralph Nickleby motionless as a statue .
