# text = But , Newman laying his finger upon his lips , she had the presence of mind to refrain said Newman , gliding out of his recess , and accompanying her across the hall Two very large tears , by-the-bye , were running down Newman's face as he spoke said poor Noggs , drawing from his pocket what seemed to be a very old duster , and wiping Kate's eyes with it , as gently as if she were an infant With these disjointed exclamations , Newman wiped his own eyes with the afore-mentioned duster , and , limping to the street-door , opened it to let her out whispered Newman answered Kate , hurrying out rejoined Newman , opening the door again a little way to say so And Newman Noggs opened the door once again to nod cheerfully , and laugh -- and shut it , to shake his head mournfully , and cry .
