# text = It was not worth his while to be serious with him , however , so he dismissed the pantomimist , with a gentle hint that if he offended again it would be under the penalty of a broken head ; and Mr Folair , taking the caution in exceedingly good part , walked away to confer with his principal , and give such an account of his proceedings as he might think best calculated to carry on the joke .
