# text = Before the discomfited tragedian could raise his head from the boards , Mrs Lenville ( who , as has been before hinted , was in an interesting state ) rushed from the rear rank of ladies , and uttering a piercing scream threw herself upon the body cried Mr Lenville , sitting up , and pointing to his prostrate lady , who was holding him very tight round the waist said Nicholas , nodding his head cried Mr Lenville screamed his wife said Mr Lenville , looking round him , and drawing the back of his hand across his eyes said Nicholas returned the tragedian , scowling upwards said Nicholas With this parting advice Nicholas picked up Mr Lenville's ash stick which had flown out of his hand , and breaking it in half , threw him the pieces and withdrew , bowing slightly to the spectators as he walked out .
