# text = Mr Crummles was fain to content himself by calculating the chances of his coming back again , and taking prompt and energetic measures to make the most of him before he went away said Mr Crummles , taking off his outlaw's wig , the better to arrive at a cool-headed view of the whole case said Nicholas returned Mr Crummles inquired Nicholas , smiling rejoined the manager , scratching his head with an air of some vexation replied Nicholas said Mr Crummles , with a look of disappointment replied Nicholas , drily said Mr Crummles As Nicholas appeared by no means impressed with the solemnity of the proposed effect , but , on the contrary , received the proposition in a most irreverent manner , and laughed at it very heartily , Mr Crummles abandoned the project in its birth , and gloomily observed that they must make up the best bill they could with combats and hornpipes , and so stick to the legitimate drama .
