# text = And Miss Ledrook said Upon which Miss Snevellicci said that Miss Ledrook was a giddy thing ; and Miss Ledrook said that Miss Snevellicci needn't colour up quite so much ; and Miss Snevellicci beat Miss Ledrook , and Miss Ledrook beat Miss Snevellicci said Miss Ledrook remonstrated Miss Snevellicci Miss Ledrook made no answer , but taking Smike's arm in hers , left her friend and Nicholas to follow at their pleasure ; which it pleased them , or rather pleased Nicholas , who had no great fancy for a TETE-A-TETE under the circumstances , to do at once .
