# text = He had a very broad chest had Miss Snevellicci's papa , and he wore a threadbare blue dress-coat buttoned with gilt buttons tight across it ; and he no sooner saw Nicholas come into the room , than he whipped the two forefingers of his right hand in between the two centre buttons , and sticking his other arm gracefully a-kimbo seemed to say Such was , and in such an attitude sat Miss Snevellicci's papa , who had been in the profession ever since he had first played the ten - year-old imps in the Christmas pantomimes ; who could sing a little , dance a little , fence a little , act a little , and do everything a little , but not much ; who had been sometimes in the ballet , and sometimes in the chorus , at every theatre in London ; who was always selected in virtue of his figure to play the military visitors and the speechless noblemen ; who always wore a smart dress , and came on arm-in-arm with a smart lady in short petticoats ,-- and always did it too with such an air that people in the pit had been several times known to cry out under the impression that he was somebody .
# sent_id = 1688
