# text = So saying Miss Snevellicci's papa rubbed the tip of his nose with a very yellow silk handkerchief , and gave the company to understand that these recollections overcame him said Nicholas replied the collector said Nicholas , laughing replied Mr Lillyvick solemnly whispered the collector , drawing him aside replied Nicholas , glancing at the late Miss Petowker whispered the collector said Nicholas rejoined the collector With such inquires , and many more such , Mr Lillyvick jerked his elbow into Nicholas's side , and chuckled till his face became quite purple in the attempt to keep down his satisfaction .
