# text = Next day the posters appeared in due course , and the public were informed , in all the colours of the rainbow , and in letters afflicted with every possible variation of spinal deformity , how that Mr Johnson would have the honour of making his last appearance that evening , and how that an early application for places was requested , in consequence of the extraordinary overflow attendant on his performances ,-- it being a remarkable fact in theatrical history , but one long since established beyond dispute , that it is a hopeless endeavour to attract people to a theatre unless they can be first brought to believe that they will never get into it .
