# text = He was half-way downstairs before Mr Crummles had sufficiently recovered his surprise to gasp out something about the posters replied Nicholas returned Crummles replied Nicholas , impatiently asked the manager , following him down to the door rejoined Nicholas Accompanying these words with an impatient stamp upon the ground , he tore himself from the manager's detaining grasp , and darting rapidly down the street was out of sight in an instant said Mr Crummles , looking wistfully towards the point at which he had just disappeared Mr Crummles being in a moralising mood , might possibly have moralised for some minutes longer if he had not mechanically put his hand towards his waistcoat pocket , where he was accustomed to keep his snuff .
