# text = The manager made no reply , but strained him to his breast again , exclaiming as he did so In fact , Mr Crummles , who could never lose any opportunity for professional display , had turned out for the express purpose of taking a public farewell of Nicholas ; and to render it the more imposing , he was now , to that young gentleman's most profound annoyance , inflicting upon him a rapid succession of stage embraces , which , as everybody knows , are performed by the embracer's laying his or her chin on the shoulder of the object of affection , and looking over it .
