# text = He thought of what his home might be if Kate were there ; he placed her in the empty chair , looked upon her , heard her speak ; he felt again upon his arm the gentle pressure of the trembling hand ; he strewed his costly rooms with the hundred silent tokens of feminine presence and occupation ; he came back again to the cold fireside and the silent dreary splendour ; and in that one glimpse of a better nature , born as it was in selfish thoughts , the rich man felt himself friendless , childless , and alone .
