# text = Having made various ineffective attempts to fit the parcel ( which was some two feet square ) into the crown thereof , Newman took it under his arm , and after putting on his fingerless gloves with great precision and nicety , keeping his eyes fixed upon Mr Ralph Nickleby all the time , he adjusted his hat upon his head with as much care , real or pretended , as if it were a bran-new one of the most expensive quality , and at last departed on his errand .
