# text = But Newman merely uttering the monosyllable as if it were some cabalistic word , at sound of which bolts would fly back and doors open , pushed briskly past and gained the door of Miss La Creevy's sitting-room , before the astonished servant could offer any opposition said Miss La Creevy in reply to the sound of Newman's knuckles ; and in he walked accordingly cried Miss La Creevy , starting as Newman bolted in said Newman , with an inclination of the head He glanced , as he spoke , at his shabby clothes and paralytic limb , and slightly shook his head said Miss La Creevy , rising to receive Newman , who met her half-way asked Newman said Miss La Creevy said Newman , sadly replied the miniature painter said the miniature painter , brightening up and clapping her hands
