# text = Therefore it was finally determined that matters should be so arranged , and Newman , after listening to many supplementary cautions and entreaties , took his leave of Miss La Creevy and trudged back to Golden Square ; ruminating as he went upon a vast number of possibilities and impossibilities which crowded upon his brain , and arose out of the conversation that had just terminated cried Nicholas , throwing back his greatcoat and rousing Smike from a long nap observed the coachman , looking over his shoulder at Nicholas with no very pleasant expression of countenance was the reply remarked the coachman and so saying , he let out his whip-lash and touched up a little boy on the calves of his legs by way of emphasis .
