# text = They rattled on through the noisy , bustling , crowded street of London , now displaying long double rows of brightly-burning lamps , dotted here and there with the chemists' glaring lights , and illuminated besides with the brilliant flood that streamed from the windows of the shops , where sparkling jewellery , silks and velvets of the richest colours , the most inviting delicacies , and most sumptuous articles of luxurious ornament , succeeded each other in rich and glittering profusion .
