# text = This question was most opportunely put , for at that instant Mr Wititterly walked in , and to him Kate introduced her brother , who at once announced his purpose , and the impossibility of deferring it said Mr Wititterly , with the gravity of a man on the right side interposed Nicholas Mr Wititterly bowed , but offered no opposition to Kate's immediate departure ; with which , indeed , he was rather gratified than otherwise , Sir Tumley Snuffim having given it as his opinion , that she rather disagreed with Mrs Wititterly's constitution said Mr Wititterly here he was interrupted by a violent fit of coughing Mr Wititterly , it should be observed , was accustomed to owe small accounts , and to leave them owing .
