# text = Wherefore , although the good lady had been subjected to a full hour's preparation by little Miss La Creevy , and was now addressed in most lucid terms both by Nicholas and his sister , she was in a state of singular bewilderment and confusion , and could by no means be made to comprehend the necessity of such hurried proceedings said Mrs Nickleby returned Nicholas said Mrs Nickleby , crying bitterly said Nicholas exclaimed Mrs Nickleby With which expressions of sorrow , Mrs Nickleby gave fresh vent to her grief , and wept piteously .
