# text = And notwithstanding various blandishments on the part of Mr Mantalini , Madame Mantalini still said no , and said it too with such determined and resolute ill-temper , that Mr Mantalini was clearly taken aback said Madame Mantalini , addressing herself to Ralph , who leant against his easy-chair with his hands behind him , and regarded the amiable couple with a smile of the supremest and most unmitigated contempt answered Ralph , sarcastically returned Madame Mantalini said Madame Mantalini , wiping her eyes Mr Mantalini groaned slightly , and buttoned his trousers pocket continued Madame Mantalini Mr Mantalini groaned once more from behind his wife's bonnet , and fitting a sovereign into one of his eyes , winked with the other at Ralph .
