# text = Having achieved this performance with great dexterity , he whipped the coin into his pocket , and groaned again with increased penitence said Madame Mantalini , as tokens of impatience manifested themselves in Ralph's countenance inquired Mr Mantalini , who did not seem to have caught the words said Madame Mantalini , looking at Ralph , and prudently abstaining from the slightest glance at her husband , lest his many graces should induce her to falter in her resolution Mr Mantalini waited , with much decorum , to hear the amount of the proposed stipend , but when it reached his ears , he cast his hat and cane upon the floor , and drawing out his pocket-handkerchief , gave vent to his feelings in a dismal moan cried Mr Mantalini , suddenly skipping out of his chair , and as suddenly skipping into it again , to the great discomposure of his lady's nerves Comforting himself with this assurance , Mr Mantalini closed his eyes and waited patiently till such time as he should wake up observed Ralph with a sneer exclaimed Mr Mantalini , opening his eyes at the sound of Ralph's voice returned Madame Mantalini -- still reproachfully , but in a softened tone cried Mr Mantalini , smiting himself on the head said Madame Mantalini , sobbing at the dreadful picture exclaimed Mr Mantalini replied Madame Mantalini cried her husband reasoned Madame Mantalini replied her disconsolate husband
