# text = These agreeable reflections occurred to Ralph Nickleby , as sundry small caresses and endearments , supposed to be unseen , were exchanged between the objects of his thoughts said Madame Mantalini Mr Mantalini answered , in the first instance , by tapping Madame Mantalini several times on the nose , and then , by remarking in words that he had nothing more to say he added almost immediately , drawing Ralph into a corner asked Ralph asked Mr Mantalini answered Ralph with great composure cried Mr Mantalini in a long shrill whistle replied Ralph , shrugging his shoulders carelessly , as if to give his questioner to understand that he had no curiosity upon the subject cried Mantalini .
