# text = Ralph shrugged his shoulders again , as if it were no great feat to amaze Mr Mantalini , and cast a wistful glance at the face of Newman Noggs , which had several times appeared behind a couple of panes of glass in the room door ; it being a part of Newman's duty , when unimportant people called , to make various feints of supposing that the bell had rung for him to show them out : by way of a gentle hint to such visitors that it was time to go said Mr Mantalini , taking Ralph by the button snarled Ralph , clenching his fists and turning a livid white said Mantalini , alarmed at these demonstrations cried Ralph growled Ralph Gad , Nickleby ,' said Mr Mantalini , retreating towards his wife rejoined Ralph , forcing a smile said Mr Mantalini , picking up his cane .
