# text = Ralph affected to smile , and once more inquired from whom Mr Mantalini had derived his information replied Mantalini asked Ralph , knitting his brows interposed Ralph with gleaming eyes Mantalini shook his head said Ralph , turning away he added , looking round again rejoined Mantalini , shaking his head again said Mr Mantalini , rather at a loss for a simile said Ralph , hesitating a little replied Mr Mantalini , in an admiring tone interposed Madame Mantalini rejoined Mr Mantalini soothingly With which remarks , and many more , no less intellectual and to the purpose , Mr Mantalini kissed the fingers of his gloves to Ralph Nickleby , and drawing his lady's arm through his , led her mincingly away muttered Ralph , dropping into his chair asked Newman , suddenly popping in his head replied Ralph , with equal abruptness .
