# text = Squeers nodded said Ralph replied Squeers , tartly said Ralph rejoined Squeers said Ralph , raising his eyes to the schoolmaster's face replied Squeers cried Ralph , interrupting him After a long pause , during which Ralph appeared absorbed in contemplation , he again broke silence by asking Squeers stated his name retorted Ralph answered Squeers interrupted Ralph returned Squeers , briskly , as if he felt relieved by the suggestion touching his forehead muttered Ralph returned Squeers with a grin said Ralph replied Squeers , becoming more and more easy and familiar in his manner , as Ralph pursued his inquiries with the less reserve demanded Ralph replied Squeers suggested Ralph drily returned Squeers , rubbing his knees said Squeers , dropping his voice , and drawing his chair still closer to Ralph said Ralph , laying his hand on the arm of the Yorkshire schoolmaster echoed Squeers said Ralph interrupted Squeers Bawling these requests to Newman Noggs , Mr Squeers betook himself to the little back-office , and fitted on his child's hat with parental anxiety , while Newman , with his pen behind his ear , sat , stiff and immovable , on his stool , regarding the father and son by turns with a broad stare said Squeers , throwing his head a little on one side , and falling back to the desk , the better to estimate the proportions of little Wackford said Newman pursued Squeers replied Newman , suddenly thrusting his face into that of Squeers Having uttered these fragmentary observations , Newman dropped upon his desk and began to write with most marvellous rapidity cried Squeers , colouring Newman made no reply said Squeers .
