# text = And now , to be defied and spurned , to be held up to her in the worst and most repulsive colours , to know that she was taught to hate and despise him : to feel that there was infection in his touch , and taint in his companionship -- to know all this , and to know that the mover of it all was that same boyish poor relation who had twitted him in their very first interview , and openly bearded and braved him since , wrought his quiet and stealthy malignity to such a pitch , that there was scarcely anything he would not have hazarded to gratify it , if he could have seen his way to some immediate retaliation .
