# text = And being , by this time , in a pleasant frame of mind for slumber , Ralph Nickleby went to bed Having established his mother and sister in the apartments of the kind-hearted miniature painter , and ascertained that Sir Mulberry Hawk was in no danger of losing his life , Nicholas turned his thoughts to poor Smike , who , after breakfasting with Newman Noggs , had remained , in a disconsolate state , at that worthy creature's lodgings , waiting , with much anxiety , for further intelligence of his protector thought Nicholas Nicholas said ' they ', but his misgivings were confined to one person .
