# text = At length the door opened again , and a lady in mourning came in ; and Nicholas kissing the lady in mourning affectionately , and calling her his mother , led her towards the chair from which Smike had risen when she entered the room said Nicholas replied Mrs Nickleby , looking very hard at her new friend , and bending to him with something more of majesty than the occasion seemed to require said Mrs Nickleby With which remarks , Mrs Nickleby turned to her daughter , and inquired , in an audible whisper , whether the gentleman was going to stop all night said Mrs Nickleby Kate stepped gracefully forward , and without any show of annoyance or irritation , breathed a few words into her mother's ear said Mrs Nickleby , shrinking back added Mrs Nickleby , turning round with an air of less reserve than she had before assumed replied Nicholas
