# text = After which , there was a profound silence said Tim , breaking out all at once , and looking very resolute said brother Charles , looking at him without the faintest spark of anger , and with a countenance radiant with attachment to the old clerk said Tim , making a calculation in the air with his pen , and drawing an imaginary line before he cast it up said Tim , with sudden energy , and looking sternly about him added Tim , sinking his voice a little roared the twins by one impulse , and blowing their old noses violently said Tim , squaring his shoulders again With these words , Tim Linkinwater stalked out , and shut himself up in his glass case , with the air of a man who had had his say , and was thoroughly resolved not to be put down .
