# text = The brothers interchanged looks , and coughed some half-dozen times without speaking said the other , warmly replied brother Ned , nodding his head as a man thoroughly determined said the other And with any disjointed and unconnected words which would prevent Nicholas from pouring forth his thanks , the brothers hurried him out : shaking hands with him all the way , and affecting very unsuccessfully -- they were poor hands at deception !-- to be wholly unconscious of the feelings that completely mastered him .
