# text = Some said one thing , and some another ; but all talked together , and all agreed upon two points : first , that it was very meritorious and highly praiseworthy in Mrs Kenwigs to do as she had done : and secondly , that there never was such a skilful and scientific doctor as that Dr Lumbey .
