# text = At this juncture , proclamation was made by another married lady , that the baby had begun to eat like anything ; whereupon the two married ladies , already mentioned , rushed tumultuously into the bedroom to behold him in the act resumed Nicholas said Mr Kenwigs added Nicholas said Mr Kenwigs said Mr Kenwigs , ruminating suggested Nicholas said Mr Kenwigs Hearing this mention of their old friend's name , the four Miss Kenwigses gathered round Nicholas , open eyed and mouthed , to hear more .
