# text = Appearances were certainly not in Mr Kenwigs's favour , for the exertion of speaking with so much vehemence , and yet in such a tone as should prevent his lamentations reaching the ears of Mrs Kenwigs , had made him very black in the face ; besides which , the excitement of the occasion , and an unwonted indulgence in various strong cordials to celebrate it , had swollen and dilated his features to a most unusual extent .
