# text = Then , the matrons again expatiated on the expediency of taking the good gentleman to bed ; observing that he would be better tomorrow , and that they knew what was the wear and tear of some men's minds when their wives were taken as Mrs Kenwigs had been that day , and that it did him great credit , and there was nothing to be ashamed of in it ; far from it ; they liked to see it , they did , for it showed a good heart .
