# text = There was not such an eventful story in the whole range of anecdote , as Tim could tell concerning the acquisition of that very bird ; how , compassionating his starved and suffering condition , he had purchased him , with the view of humanely terminating his wretched life ; how he determined to wait three days and see whether the bird revived ; how , before half the time was out , the bird did revive ; and how he went on reviving and picking up his appetite and good looks until he gradually became what Tim would say , glancing proudly at the cage .
