# text = The cap was all safe , however -- that was one comfort -- and it was no use scolding him -- that was another ; so the boy went upon his way rejoicing , and Tim Linkinwater's sister presented herself to the company below-stairs , just five minutes after the half-hour had struck by Tim Linkinwater's own infallible clock .
