# text = They were four in all , and as they came in , bowing , and grinning , and blushing , the housekeeper , and cook , and housemaid , brought up the rear said brother Ned , filling a corresponding number of glasses with the double-diamond With this singular contradiction of terms , brother Ned gave Tim Linkinwater a slap on the back , which made him look , for the moment , almost as apoplectic as the butler : and tossed off the contents of his glass in a twinkling .
