# text = But before he had said a dozen words , Mrs Nickleby , with many sly winks and nods , observed , that she was sure Mr Smike must be quite tired out , and that she positively must insist on his not sitting up a minute longer said Mrs Nickleby , when Smike had wished them good-night and left the room With which preface , Mrs Nickleby took her nightcap from between the leaves of a very large prayer-book where it had been folded up small , and proceeded to tie it on : talking away in her usual discursive manner , all the time observed Mrs Nickleby Nicholas laughed , and entering no further into the subject of this lengthened harangue , reverted to the pleasant tone of the little birthday party .
