# text = And as Mrs Nickleby instantly became very curious respecting it , and made a great number of inquiries touching what they had had for dinner , and how it was put on table , and whether it was overdone or underdone , and who was there , and what ' the Mr Cherrybles' said , and what Nicholas said , and what the Mr Cherrybles said when he said that ; Nicholas described the festivities at full length , and also the occurrences of the morning said Nicholas said Mrs Nickleby , putting her feet upon the fender , and drawing her chair close to it , as if settling herself for a long talk Nicholas stopped in the middle of a sleepy yawn , as his mother began to speak : and looked at her with fixed attention said Mrs Nickleby said Nicholas quietly cried Mrs Nickleby said Mrs Nickleby , wiping her eyes said Nicholas , kindly said Mrs Nickleby , pondering
