# text = Which seemed just what Mrs Nickleby had expected him to be she said repeated Nicholas , in great astonishment replied Mrs Nickleby in a very serious tone said Nicholas , firing immediately replied Mrs Nickleby said Nicholas Nicholas stopped short ; for there was an indescribable expression of placid triumph , mingled with a modest confusion , lingering between the borders of Mrs Nickleby's nightcap , which arrested his attention suddenly said Mrs Nickleby said Nicholas returned his mother in a peevish tone exclaimed Mrs Nickleby , with a half - simper Despite his vexation and concern , Nicholas could scarcely help smiling , as he rejoined added Mrs Nickleby , after a momentary pause inquired Nicholas , fretted almost beyond endurance , but looking nearly as resigned and patient as Mrs Nickleby herself replied Mrs Nickleby , tossing her head and looking at the ashes in the grate asked Nicholas cried Mrs Nickleby muttered Nicholas said Mrs Nickleby added Mrs Nickleby , with increased confusion asked Nicholas answered his mother rejoined Nicholas , rising So saying , Nicholas kissed his mother , and bade her good-night , and they retired to their respective chambers .
