# text = Such was the result to which Miss La Creevy's ruminations and observations led her , when the cottage had been , as she emphatically said and the busy little woman had at length a moment's time to think about its inmates said Miss La Creevy returned Kate , smiling said Miss La Creevy asked Kate , anxiously returned Miss La Creevy , anticipating the close of the sentence asked Kate said Miss La Creevy , pausing to consider said the miniature painter said Kate returned her little friend , with a gravity very unusual in her said Miss La Creevy , relapsing into the cheerful , chattering tone , which was habitual to her So saying , little Miss La Creevy hid her face in a very flat bonnet , and herself in a very big shawl ; and fixing herself tightly into the latter , by means of a large pin , declared that the omnibus might come as soon as it pleased , for she was quite ready .
