# text = Leaving it to pursue its journey at the pleasure of the conductor aforementioned , who lounged gracefully on his little shelf behind , smoking an odoriferous cigar ; and leaving it to stop , or go on , or gallop , or crawl , as that gentleman deemed expedient and advisable ; this narrative may embrace the opportunity of ascertaining the condition of Sir Mulberry Hawk , and to what extent he had , by this time , recovered from the injuries consequent on being flung violently from his cabriolet , under the circumstances already detailed .
