# text = Then was heard a subdued footstep on the stairs ; and Ralph Nickleby , hat in hand , crept softly into the room , with his body bent forward as if in profound respect , and his eyes fixed upon the face of his worthy client said Sir Mulberry , motioning him to the chair by the couch side , and waving his hand in assumed carelessness rejoined Ralph , with the same steady gaze Ralph's manner was one of profound humility and respect ; and the low tone of voice was that , which the gentlest consideration for a sick man would have taught a visitor to assume .
