# text = As he turned his face , Ralph recoiled a step or two , and making as though he were irresistibly impelled to express astonishment , but was determined not to do so , sat down with well-acted confusion said Ralph said Ralph , bending forward , and allowing the same harsh smile to gather upon his face , as the other closed his eyes returned Sir Mulberry , tossing his arm restlessly upon the coverlet .
