# text = He was still more surprised when , Sir Mulberry ceasing to speak , the young lord angrily , and almost unaffectedly , requested never to have the subject renewed in his presence he added , with unusual energy interrupted his friend said the other , turning full upon him With this emphatic repetition of his concluding words , the young lord turned upon his heel ; but before he had reached the adjoining room he turned back again , and said , with even greater vehemence than he had displayed before So saying , Lord Frederick Verisopht walked out of the room , leaving Ralph Nickleby and Sir Mulberry in most unpleasant astonishment asked Ralph , softly replied Sir Mulberry Hawk , biting his lip , and pointing to the door Ralph exchanged a familiar look with his old acquaintance ; for they had suddenly grown confidential again in this alarming surprise ; and took his way home , thoughtfully and slowly .
