# text = Now , the good - nature of the little miniature painter would by no means allow of Smike's walking back again , until he had been previously refreshed with just a sip of something comfortable and a mixed biscuit or so ; and Smike , entertaining no objection either to the sip of something comfortable , or the mixed biscuit , but , considering on the contrary that they would be a very pleasant preparation for a walk to Bow , it fell out that he delayed much longer than he originally intended , and that it was some half-hour after dusk when he set forth on his journey home .
