# text = Mr Squeers sat himself down on the opposite seat to the unfortunate Smike , and , planting his hands firmly on his knees , looked at him for some five minutes , when , seeming to recover from his trance , he uttered a loud laugh , and slapped his old pupil's face several times -- taking the right and left sides alternately said Squeers and being quite assured of his good fortune by these experiments , Mr Squeers administered a few boxes on the ear , lest the entertainments should seem to partake of sameness , and laughed louder and longer at every one said Squeers to his son replied Master Wackford said Squeers said little Wackford .
