# text = ' The very boy ', said Squeers , putting his fist close to Smike's nose , and drawing it away again , and repeating the process several times , with a vicious aspect And here Mr Squeers related how , and in what manner , and when and where , he had picked up the runaway said Mr Snawley , casting down his eyes with an air of humility , and elevating his fork , with a bit of lobster on the top of it , towards the ceiling replied Mr Squeers , scratching his nose said Mr Snawley rejoined Squeers , taking a little roll of notes from his pocket-book , to see that they were all safe said Mr Squeers , when he had satisfied himself upon this point said Mrs Snawley inquired Snawley interposed Squeers , confronting him again
