# text = He had no sooner succeeded in suppressing this emotion , than he slipped off his shoes , and creeping to the adjoining room where the prisoner was confined , turned the key , which was on the outside , and darting in , covered Smike's mouth with his huge hand before he could utter a sound whispered the Yorkshireman to the bewildered lad cried Smike replied John , stopping his mouth again , the instant he had said this much cried Smike replied John said John , sadly Smike opened his mouth to speak , but John Browdie stopped him said the Yorkshireman With this caution , John Browdie shook his head significantly , and drawing a screwdriver from his pocket , took off the box of the lock in a very deliberate and workmanlike manner , and laid it , together with the implement , on the floor said John ' Thot be thy doin '.
