# text = Without pausing for a moment to reflect upon the course he was taking , or the probability of its leading him homewards or the reverse , he fled away with surprising swiftness and constancy of purpose , borne upon such wings as only Fear can wear , and impelled by imaginary shouts in the well remembered voice of Squeers , who , with a host of pursuers , seemed to the poor fellow's disordered senses to press hard upon his track ; now left at a greater distance in the rear , and now gaining faster and faster upon him , as the alternations of hope and terror agitated him by turns .
