# text = Tim looked wistfully at him , for a moment , as if he were encouraged by the tone of this reply to be more communicative on the subject ; and sticking behind his ear , a pen that he had been making , and shutting up his knife with a smart click , said said Tim , pondering said Tim , breaking off said Nicholas said Tim asked Nicholas replied Tim , ' and other people too ; but no one seems to care much for the poor sickly cripple .
