# text = At length Tim Linkinwater came back -- provokingly cool , and with papers in his hand , and a pen in his mouth , as if nothing had happened said Nicholas , impetuously returned Tim Linkinwater repeated Nicholas said Tim , taking his pen out of his mouth returned Nicholas said Tim Linkinwater , putting on his spectacles returned Nicholas replied Mr Linkinwater , gravely asked Nicholas said Tim said Nicholas , looking earnestly at the other replied the immovable Tim Nicholas hazarded one or two further remarks , but it was evident that Tim Linkinwater had his own reasons for evading the subject , and that he was determined to afford no further information respecting the fair unknown , who had awakened so much curiosity in the breast of his young friend .
