# text = Nothing daunted by this repulse , Nicholas returned to the charge next day , emboldened by the circumstance of Mr Linkinwater being in a very talkative and communicative mood ; but , directly he resumed the theme , Tim relapsed into a state of most provoking taciturnity , and from answering in monosyllables , came to returning no answers at all , save such as were to be inferred from several grave nods and shrugs , which only served to whet that appetite for intelligence in Nicholas , which had already attained a most unreasonable height .
