# text = Still , though he loved and languished after the most orthodox models , and was only deterred from making a confidante of Kate by the slight considerations of having never , in all his life , spoken to the object of his passion , and having never set eyes upon her , except on two occasions , on both of which she had come and gone like a flash of lightning -- or , as Nicholas himself said , in the numerous conversations he held with himself , like a vision of youth and beauty much too bright to last -- his ardour and devotion remained without its reward .
