# text = The young lady appeared no more ; so there was a great deal of love wasted ( enough indeed to have set up half-a-dozen young gentlemen , as times go , with the utmost decency ), and nobody was a bit the wiser for it ; not even Nicholas himself , who , on the contrary , became more dull , sentimental , and lackadaisical , every day .
