# text = To get through them with the greater dispatch , Tim Linkinwater proposed that they should remain at the counting-house , for a week or so , until ten o'clock at night ; to this , as nothing damped the zeal of Nicholas in the service of his kind patrons -- not even romance , which has seldom business habits -- he cheerfully assented .
