# text = The first night he was not at the place of meeting ( a certain tavern about half-way between the city and Golden Square ), but on the second night he was there before Nicholas , and received him with open arms whispered Newman Nicholas needed no second invitation , and eagerly inquired what was the news said Newman , in a flutter of exultation said Nicholas eagerly replied Newman said Nicholas replied Newman repeated Nicholas , indignantly said Newman repeated Nicholas , more emphatically than before said Newman , shaking his head with great positiveness returned Nicholas , muttering the two names together over and over again in every variety of tone , to try the effect said Newman said Nicholas demanded Nicholas retorted Noggs , clapping him on the shoulder cried Nicholas , grasping his hand replied Newman said Nicholas , wringing his hand returned Newman cried Nicholas Poor Noggs literally gasped for breath as this flood of questions rushed upon him , and moved spasmodically in his chair at every fresh inquiry , staring at Nicholas meanwhile with a most ludicrous expression of perplexity said Newman asked Nicholas said Newman replied Nicholas , with his characteristic vehemence said Newman asked Nicholas said Newman said Nicholas approvingly .
