# text = And what better means could she adopt , towards so virtuous and laudable an end , than proving to all men , in her own person , that his passion was the most rational and reasonable in the world , and just the very result , of all others , which discreet and thinking persons might have foreseen , from her incautiously displaying her matured charms , without reserve , under the very eye , as it were , of an ardent and too-susceptible man said Mrs Nickleby , gravely shaking her head Whether the deceased might not have been better off if he had emigrated in his bachelor days , was a question which his relict did not stop to consider ; for Kate entered the room , with her workbox , in this stage of her reflections ; and a much slighter interruption , or no interruption at all , would have diverted Mrs Nickleby's thoughts into a new channel at any time said Mrs Nickleby replied Mrs Nickleby returned Kate , with a cheerful smile said Mrs Nickleby , with as much gravity as if it were a question of the most imminent and thrilling interest Kate laughingly replied that she was quite convinced ; and as her mama still appeared undetermined whether it was not absolutely essential that the subject should be renewed , proposed that they should take their work into the summer-house , and enjoy the beauty of the afternoon .
