# text = This remarkable appearance was succeeded by another of a precisely similar description ; then a fine vegetable marrow , of unusually large dimensions , was seen to whirl aloft , and come toppling down ; then , several cucumbers shot up together ; and , finally , the air was darkened by a shower of onions , turnip-radishes , and other small vegetables , which fell rolling and scattering , and bumping about , in all directions .
