# text = Here he smiled , kissed his hand , and made several low bows he added , dropping his voice almost to a whisper murmured Kate replied Mrs Nickleby , in the same tone of voice said the gentleman , with a languishing look returned Mrs Nickleby said the old gentleman , laying his finger on his nose , with an air of familiarity , most reprehensible here he kissed his hand and bowed again observed Mrs Nickleby , turning to her daughter rejoined Kate Mrs Nickleby looked very grand , not to say contemptuous , at this humiliating proposal ; and , turning to the old gentleman , who had watched them during these whispers with absorbing eagerness , said If Mrs Nickleby's excellent papa had borne , in his best days , a resemblance to the neighbour now looking over the wall , he must have been , to say the least , a very queer-looking old gentleman in his prime .
