# text = Assured that there were not , he tapped his nose several times , accompanying the action with a cunning look , as though congratulating himself on his caution ; and stretching out his neck , said in a loud whisper replied Mrs Nickleby , making a feint of retreating towards the house said the old gentleman replied Mrs Nickleby inquired the old gentleman with great anxiety returned Mrs Nickleby , with some warmth said Mrs Nickleby , drawing herself up whispered Kate said Mrs Nickleby , angrily whimpered Mrs Nickleby cried the old gentleman , with such an energetic jump , that he fell down two or three steps and grated his chin against the wall Issuing these commands , as if there were a dozen attendants all actively engaged in their execution , he turned his velvet cap inside out , put it on with great dignity so as to obscure his right eye and three-fourths of his nose , and sticking his arms a-kimbo , looked very fiercely at a sparrow hard by , till the bird flew away , when he put his cap in his pocket with an air of great satisfaction , and addressed himself with respectful demeanour to Mrs Nickleby such were his words said Mrs Nickleby faintly , and looking another way said the old gentleman , flourishing his right hand negligently , as if he made very light of such matters , and speaking very fast he looked towards his house and spoke very low Repeating these last words with great rapture and enthusiasm , the old gentleman put on his black velvet cap again , and looking up into the sky in a hasty manner , said something that was not quite intelligible concerning a balloon he expected , and which was rather after its time repeated the old gentleman said Mrs Nickleby reasoned Kate said Mrs Nickleby cried the old gentleman said Mrs Nickleby , fixing her eyes modestly on the ground cried the old gentleman resumed Mrs Nickleby , with perfect seriousness
