# text = Towards their conclusion , the suitor evinced a very irreverent degree of inattention , and Mrs Nickleby had scarcely finished speaking , when , to the great terror both of that lady and her daughter , he suddenly flung off his coat , and springing on the top of the wall , threw himself into an attitude which displayed his small-clothes and grey worsteds to the fullest advantage , and concluded by standing on one leg , and repeating his favourite bellow with increased vehemence .
