# text = Thus encumbered the old gentleman lifted his legs awkwardly once or twice , as if they were very clumsy and imperfect pieces of machinery , and then looking down on his own side of the wall , burst into a loud laugh said the old gentleman replied a gruff voice said the old gentleman was the reply said the old gentleman , with much interest answered the gruff voice observed the old gentleman said the man on the other side One of the hands being then cautiously unclasped , the old gentleman dropped into a sitting posture , and was looking round to smile and bow to Mrs Nickleby , when he disappeared with some precipitation , as if his legs had been pulled from below .
