# text = Very much relieved by his disappearance , Kate was turning to speak to her mama , when the dirty hands again became visible , and were immediately followed by the figure of a coarse squat man , who ascended by the steps which had been recently occupied by their singular neighbour said this new comer , grinning and touching his hat said Kate rejoined the man , taking his handkerchief out of his hat and wiping his face said Kate replied the man , looking into his hat , throwing his handkerchief in at one dab , and putting it on again asked Kate said Kate , compassionately replied the keeper said Kate replied the keeper , shaking his head so emphatically that he was obliged to frown to keep his hat on With which confession of his faith , the keeper shook his head again , as much as to say that nothing short of this would do , if things were to go on at all ; and touching his hat sulkily -- not that he was in an ill humour , but that his subject ruffled him -- descended the ladder , and took it away .
