# text = Mr John Browdie , with his hands in his pockets , hovered restlessly about these delicacies , stopping occasionally to whisk the flies out of the sugar-basin with his wife's pocket-handkerchief , or to dip a teaspoon in the milk-pot and carry it to his mouth , or to cut off a little knob of crust , and a little corner of meat , and swallow them at two gulps like a couple of pills .
