# text = This turmoil , instead of quickly subsiding after the first outburst , ( as turmoils not unfrequently do , whether in taverns , legislative assemblies , or elsewhere ,) into a mere grumbling and growling squabble , increased every moment ; and although the whole din appeared to be raised by but one pair of lungs , yet that one pair was of so powerful a quality , and repeated such words as rascal and a variety of expletives no less flattering to the party addressed , with such great relish and strength of tone , that a dozen voices raised in concert under any ordinary circumstances would have made far less uproar and created much smaller consternation said Nicholas , moving hastily towards the door .
