# text = This reflection appeared to have great weight with the young lady in the bar , who ( adjusting her cap as she spoke , and glancing at a mirror ) declared that it would be a very pretty state of things indeed ; and that if people were to be punished for actions so innocent and natural as that , there would be more people to be knocked down than there would be people to knock them down , and that she wondered what the gentleman meant by it , that she did said the young gentleman in a low voice , advancing towards the sash window replied the young lady sharply , smiling though as she turned aside , and biting her lip , ( whereat Mrs Browdie , who was still standing on the stairs , glanced at her with disdain , and called to her husband to come away said the young man replied the young lady , tossing her head said the young man , looking with an air of admiration in the barmaid's face
