# text = It was , indeed , Tom , the ugly clerk said Nicholas , ruminating upon the strange manner in which the register-office seemed to start up and stare him in the face every now and then , and when he least expected it said the young man , laughing , and drawing a card from his pocket Nicholas took the card , and glancing at it involuntarily as he returned the compliment , evinced very great surprise said Nicholas returned Mr Frank , good-humouredly Nicholas responded to these compliments with others of the same kind , and they shook hands warmly .
