# text = Notwithstanding all that has been said and sung to the contrary , there is no well-established case of morning having either deferred or hastened its approach by the term of an hour or so for the mere gratification of a splenetic feeling against some unoffending lover : the sun having , in the discharge of his public duty , as the books of precedent report , invariably risen according to the almanacs , and without suffering himself to be swayed by any private considerations .
