# text = It was quite impossible to find language to express the degree of mental prostration to which such an adventurous wight would be reduced in the keen encounter with Tim Linkinwater , so Tim gave up the rest of his declaration in pure lack of words , and mounted his stool again said Charles , after he had patted Tim Linkinwater approvingly on the back returned the other added brother Ned said Tim Tim thought this such an exquisite , unparalleled , and most extraordinary joke , that he laid his pen upon the inkstand , and rather tumbling off his stool than getting down with his usual deliberation , laughed till he was quite faint , shaking his head all the time so that little particles of powder flew palpably about the office .
