# text = Young Mr Cheeryble then earnestly entreated old Mr Cheeryble to confess that it was all a jest , which old Mr Cheeryble at last did , young Mr Cheeryble being so much in earnest about it , that -- as Mrs Nickleby said many thousand times afterwards in recalling the scene -- he which she rightly considered a memorable circumstance , and one worthy of remark , young men not being as a class remarkable for modesty or self-denial , especially when there is a lady in the case , when , if they colour at all , it is rather their practice to colour the story , and not themselves .
