# text = So , nodding his head very complacently , Ralph was leaving the spot , when his quick ear caught the sound of a confused noise and hubbub of voices , mingled with a great running up and down stairs , in the very house which had been the subject of his scrutiny ; and while he was hesitating whether to knock at the door or listen at the keyhole a little longer , a female servant of Madame Mantalini's ( whom he had often seen ) opened it abruptly and bounced out , with her blue cap - ribbons streaming in the air cried Ralph said the girl said Ralph , tartly cried the girl said Ralph , catching her by the wrist Without any further expostulation , he led or rather pulled the frightened handmaid into the house , and shut the door ; then bidding her walk upstairs before him , followed without more ceremony .
