# text = At this inquiry , the clamour was increased twenty-fold , and an astounding string of such shrill contradictions as He hasn't Don't with various other cries , poured forth with bewildering volubility , until Madame Mantalini was seen to address herself to Ralph , when female curiosity to know what she would say , prevailed , and , as if by general consent , a dead silence , unbroken by a single whisper , instantaneously succeeded said Madame Mantalini
