# text = To do the excellent Miss Knag justice , she had been mainly instrumental in bringing about this altered state of things , for , finding by daily experience , that there was no chance of the business thriving , or even continuing to exist , while Mr Mantalini had any hand in the expenditure , and having now a considerable interest in its well-doing , she had sedulously applied herself to the investigation of some little matters connected with that gentleman's private character , which she had so well elucidated , and artfully imparted to Madame Mantalini , as to open her eyes more effectually than the closest and most philosophical reasoning could have done in a series of years .
