# text = Nor was Mrs Browdie much behind her husband in this respect , for that young matron , whose rustic beauty contrasted very prettily with the more delicate loveliness of Kate , and without suffering by the contrast either , for each served as it were to set off and decorate the other , could not sufficiently admire the gentle and winning manners of the young lady , or the engaging affability of the elder one .
