# text = This being purely a labour of love , Mr Squeers readily complied , and leaving the room for the purpose , almost immediately returned , supporting a sleek personage with an oily face , who , bursting from him , and giving to view the form and face of Mr Snawley , made straight up to Smike , and tucking that poor fellow's head under his arm in a most uncouth and awkward embrace , elevated his broad - brimmed hat at arm's length in the air as a token of devout thanksgiving , exclaiming , meanwhile said Ralph , with a gruff expression of sympathy cried Mr Snawley , scarcely able to believe it said John Browdie .
