# text = At this juncture , Smike escaping from his father fled to Nicholas , and implored him , in most moving terms , never to give him up , but to let him live and die beside him said Nicholas cried Squeers interposed Ralph , as Snawley was about to speak returned Squeers said Ralph replied that person said Ralph returned Snawley said Ralph replied Snawley said Snawley resumed Ralph Snawley nodded his head , and wiped his eyes ; the first slightly , the last violently continued Ralph replied Snawley said Ralph , producing one from his coat said Ralph , tossing the pocket-book upon the table With these words Ralph sat down unbidden , and compressing his lips , which were for the moment slightly parted by a smile , folded his arms , and looked for the first time at his nephew .
