# text = This compromise , which was proposed with abundance of tears and sighs , not exactly meeting the point at issue , nobody took any notice of it ; and poor Mrs Nickleby accordingly proceeded to enlighten Mrs Browdie upon the advantages of such a scheme , and the unhappy results flowing , on all occasions , from her not being attended to when she proffered her advice said Snawley , addressing the terrified Smike cried Smike , shrinking back bawled Squeers , through the keyhole Mr Snawley looked steadfastly at his son for a full minute , and then covering his eyes with his hand , and once more raising his hat in the air , appeared deeply occupied in deploring his black ingratitude .
