# text = Like the famous parrot , Nicholas thought a great deal , but was unable to utter a word said Mr Cheeryble said Nicholas continued Mr Cheeryble A short silence intervened , which Nicholas made no effort to break said the old gentleman calmly Nicholas started , and indistinctly apologising for the interruption , begged his patron to proceed resumed Mr Cheeryble said brother Charles Pursuing this encomium upon the poor follower with such energy and relish as no words can describe , brother Charles leant back in his chair , and delivered the remainder of his relation with greater composure .
