# text = Then it came out by little and little , how that the twins had been revolving in their good old heads manifold plans and schemes for helping this young lady in the most delicate and considerate way , and so that her father should not suspect the source whence the aid was derived ; and how they had at last come to the conclusion , that the best course would be to make a feint of purchasing her little drawings and ornamental work at a high price , and keeping up a constant demand for the same .
