# text = But as often , treading upon the heels of this impulse , came another which urged him to refrain , and to keep his secret to his own breast thought Nicholas Asking himself such questions as these , Nicholas mentally answered with great emphasis and persuading himself that he was a most conscientious and glorious martyr , nobly resolved to do what , if he had examined his own heart a little more carefully , he would have found he could not resist .
