# text = The Rules are a certain liberty adjoining the prison , and comprising some dozen streets in which debtors who can raise money to pay large fees , from which their creditors do NOT derive any benefit , are permitted to reside by the wise provisions of the same enlightened laws which leave the debtor who can raise no money to starve in jail , without the food , clothing , lodging , or warmth , which are provided for felons convicted of the most atrocious crimes that can disgrace humanity .
