# text = To the row of houses indicated to him by Mr Charles Cheeryble , Nicholas directed his steps , without much troubling his head with such matters as these ; and at this row of houses -- after traversing a very dirty and dusty suburb , of which minor theatricals , shell-fish , ginger-beer , spring vans , greengrocery , and brokers' shops , appeared to compose the main and most prominent features -- he at length arrived with a palpitating heart .
