# text = Then , suddenly changing his tone , he went on said Ralph , pulling out his pocket-book said old Arthur , eagerly said Ralph returned old Arthur , with a chuckle said Ralph , nodding his head deliberately , and speaking in a tone whose studied coldness presented a strange contrast to the rapturous squeak to which his friend had gradually mounted cried old Arthur , edging himself closer still to Ralph said Ralph , as stony and immovable as ever returned Arthur Gride said Ralph cried Arthur Gride said Ralph returned old Arthur feigning to be suddenly enlightened rejoined Ralph , drily said Arthur Gride rejoined Ralph , abruptly cried old Arthur , raising his hands with an imploring gesture , and speaking , in a tremulous voice Ralph took no notice of these supplications , but sat for three or four minutes in a brown study , looking thoughtfully at the person from whom they proceeded .
