# text = Finding that it was impossible to make any impression upon his staunch friend , Arthur Gride , who had prepared himself for some such result before he came , consented with a heavy heart to the proposed treaty , and upon the spot filled up the bond required ( Ralph kept such instruments handy ), after exacting the condition that Mr Nickleby should accompany him to Bray's lodgings that very hour , and open the negotiation at once , should circumstances appear auspicious and favourable to their designs .
