# text = He availed himself of this interval to buy a silver snuff-box -- the best his funds would afford -- as a token of remembrance for Mr Crummles , and having purchased besides a pair of ear-rings for Mrs Crummles , a necklace for the Phenomenon , and a flaming shirt-pin for each of the young gentlemen , he refreshed himself with a walk , and returning a little after the appointed time , found the lights out , the theatre empty , the curtain raised for the night , and Mr Crummles walking up and down the stage expecting his arrival said Mr Crummles said Nicholas replied Mr Crummles Mr Snittle Timberry now appeared , arm-in-arm with the African Swallower , and , being introduced to Nicholas , raised his hat half a foot , and said he was proud to know him .
