# text = The Swallower said the same , and looked and spoke remarkably like an Irishman said Nicholas to Mr Timberry Mr Timberry , in reply , shook his head with a gloomy air , tapped his chest several times with great significancy , and drawing his cloak more closely about him , said It is observable that when people upon the stage are in any strait involving the very last extremity of weakness and exhaustion , they invariably perform feats of strength requiring great ingenuity and muscular power .
