# text = And so natural did this sort of performance come to Mr Snittle Timberry , that on their way out of the theatre and towards the tavern where the supper was to be holden , he testified the severity of his recent indisposition and its wasting effects upon the nervous system , by a series of gymnastic performances which were the admiration of all witnesses said Mrs Crummles , when Nicholas was presented replied Nicholas said Mrs Crummles , thrusting forward the Phenomenon in a blue gauze frock , extensively flounced , and trousers of the same presenting the Master Crummleses said Nicholas , forgetting at the instant that this had been Smike's theatrical name exclaimed Mrs Crummles , with a tragic recoil said Nicholas , shaking his head , and making an attempt to smile rejoined Mrs Crummles , in her most popular manner said Nicholas , checking himself With this hasty apology Nicholas stooped down to salute the Phenomenon , and changed the subject ; inwardly cursing his precipitation , and very much wondering what Mrs Crummles must think of so sudden an explosion .
