# text = The board being now clear of the more substantial articles of food , and punch , wine , and spirits being placed upon it and handed about , the guests , who had been previously conversing in little groups of three or four , gradually fell off into a dead silence , while the majority of those present glanced from time to time at Mr Snittle Timberry , and the bolder spirits did not even hesitate to strike the table with their knuckles , and plainly intimate their expectations , by uttering such encouragements as Wake up , Mr Chairman and so forth .
