# text = At length Mr Snittle Timberry rose in the most approved attitude , with one hand in the breast of his waistcoat and the other on the nearest snuff-box , and having been received with great enthusiasm , proposed , with abundance of quotations , his friend Mr Vincent Crummles : ending a pretty long speech by extending his right hand on one side and his left on the other , and severally calling upon Mr and Mrs Crummles to grasp the same .
