# text = If brother Charles and brother Ned failed to look in for at least a few minutes every Sunday , or one evening in the week , there was Mr Tim Linkinwater ( who had never made half-a-dozen other acquaintances in all his life , and who took such delight in his new friends as no words can express ) constantly coming and going in his evening walks , and stopping to rest ; while Mr Frank Cheeryble happened , by some strange conjunction of circumstances , to be passing the door on some business or other at least three nights in the week said Mrs Nickleby to her daughter one evening , when this last-named gentleman had been the subject of the worthy lady's eulogium for some time , and Kate had sat perfectly silent rejoined Kate cried Mrs Nickleby , with her wonted suddenness returned her mother returned Kate , colouring again ; and this time beyond all dispute returned Mrs Nickleby rejoined Kate quickly retorted Mrs Nickleby returned Kate she added , in a more gentle tone said Mrs Nickleby , emphatically returned Kate , hastily said Mrs Nickleby , opening her eyes in great astonishment .
