# text = Kate was commonly the life and soul of the conversation at home ; but she was more silent than usual upon this occasion ( perhaps because Tim and Miss La Creevy engrossed so much of it ), and , keeping aloof from the talkers , sat at the window watching the shadows as the evening closed in , and enjoying the quiet beauty of the night , which seemed to have scarcely less attractions to Frank , who first lingered near , and then sat down beside , her .
