# text = It was greatly increased when it was discovered that Kate had not the least appetite for supper : a discovery so alarming that there is no knowing in what unaccountable efforts of oratory Mrs Nickleby's apprehensions might have been vented , if the general attention had not been attracted , at the moment , by a very strange and uncommon noise , proceeding , as the pale and trembling servant girl affirmed , and as everybody's sense of hearing seemed to affirm also , ' right down ' the chimney of the adjoining room .
