# text = It succeeded to a miracle ; and he went away in a rapture of admiration , strongly guarded by Tim Linkinwater on one side , and Frank himself on the other murmured Mrs Nickleby , reviving when the coast was clear She was assured that he was said Mrs Nickleby said Kate , greatly astonished replied Mrs Nickleby , with a desperate calmness said Kate mildly rejoined her mother Washing her hands , thus , of all responsibility under this head , past , present , or to come , Mrs Nickleby kindly added that she hoped her children might never have greater cause to reproach themselves than she had , and prepared herself to receive the escort , who soon returned with the intelligence that the old gentleman was safely housed , and that they found his custodians , who had been making merry with some friends , wholly ignorant of his absence .
