# text = Kate blushed to find , when Nicholas returned , how long she had been sitting alone , occupied with her own thoughts she said rejoined Nicholas gaily Kate was confused ; she toyed with some trifle on the table , looked up and smiled , looked down and dropped a tear said Nicholas , drawing his sister towards him and kissing her There was something in this proposition , albeit it was said without the slightest consciousness or application , which so alarmed his sister , that Nicholas laughingly changed the subject to domestic matters , and thus gathered , by degrees , as they left the room and went upstairs together , how lonely Smike had been all night -- and by very slow degrees , too ; for on this subject also , Kate seemed to speak with some reluctance said Nicholas , tapping gently at his door Kate was hanging on her brother's arm .
