# text = These would be hanging on the outskirts of a wide circle of people assembled round some itinerant juggler , opposed , in his turn , by a noisy band of music , or the classic game of while ventriloquists holding dialogues with wooden dolls , and fortune-telling women smothering the cries of real babies , divided with them , and many more , the general attention of the company .
