# text = This call , loudly repeated twice or thrice at the room-door , brought into the apartment a short , thin , weasen , blear-eyed old woman , palsy-stricken and hideously ugly , who , wiping her shrivelled face upon her dirty apron , inquired , in that subdued tone in which deaf people commonly speak said Arthur Gride , tapping himself on the breast to render the reply more intelligible returned Peg cried Arthur Gride rejoined Peg , after a short inspection of the suit replied old Arthur retorted Peg returned her master said Peg said Peg , sharply Arthur Gride muttered an imprecation on his housekeeper's deafness , as he roared in her ear cried Peg With which consolatory assurance , Peg Sliderskew gathered up the chosen suit , and folding her skinny arms upon the bundle , stood , mouthing , and grinning , and blinking her watery eyes , like an uncouth figure in some monstrous piece of carving said Arthur , with not the best possible grace rejoined the old woman said Arthur Gride , appalled by the mention of the word returned Peg , shaking her forefinger said Arthur Gride , eagerly watching what effect his communication produced upon the old woman's countenance returned Peg exclaimed Arthur he softly added by way of soliloquy said Peg muttered Arthur ; adding with an ugly leer said Peg approvingly thought Arthur Gride Although he thought this very distinctly , he durst not move his lips lest the old woman should detect him .
