# text = These she prolonged until she had hobbled to the door , when she exchanged them for a sour malignant look , and twisting her under-jaw from side to side , muttered hearty curses upon the future Mrs Gride , as she crept slowly down the stairs , and paused for breath at nearly every one said Arthur Gride , when he found himself again alone Having extolled the merits of his domestic in these high terms , old Arthur went back to the burden of his song .
