# text = He no sooner understood it all , than with a face of ashy paleness , and trembling in every limb , he darted from the house cried Newman , bolting out in pursuit Finding that Newman was determined to arrest his progress at any hazard , and apprehensive that some well-intentioned passenger , attracted by the cry of might lay violent hands upon his person , and place him in a disagreeable predicament from which he might have some difficulty in extricating himself , Nicholas soon slackened his pace , and suffered Newman Noggs to come up with him : which he did , in so breathless a condition , that it seemed impossible he could have held out for a minute longer said Nicholas replied Newman said Nicholas , pressing onward said Newman cried Nicholas said Noggs rejoined Nicholas after a pause , and taking his hand as he spoke
