# text = Now , between the italian-ironing of frills , the flouncing of trousers , the trimming of frocks , the faintings and the comings-to again , incidental to the occasion , Mrs Kenwigs had been so entirely occupied , that she had not observed , until within half an hour before , that the flaxen tails of Miss Morleena's hair were , in a manner , run to seed ; and that , unless she were put under the hands of a skilful hairdresser , she never could achieve that signal triumph over the daughters of all other people , anything less than which would be tantamount to defeat .
