# text = This discovery drove Mrs Kenwigs to despair ; for the hairdresser lived three streets and eight dangerous crossings off ; Morleena could not be trusted to go there alone , even if such a proceeding were strictly proper : of which Mrs Kenwigs had her doubts ; Mr Kenwigs had not returned from business ; and there was nobody to take her .
