# text = So , Mrs Kenwigs first slapped Miss Kenwigs for being the cause of her vexation , and then shed tears said Mrs Kenwigs replied Morleena , also in tears said Mrs Kenwigs who was the daughter of the ambitious neighbour Deploring the evil-mindedness of her eldest daughter in these terms , Mrs Kenwigs distilled fresh drops of vexation from her eyes , and declared that she did believe there never was anybody so tried as she was .
