# text = The better informed among the sex , however , made light of this assertion , for however willing they were ( and they were very willing ) to do full justice to the handsome face and figure of the proprietor , they held the countenance of the dark gentleman in the window to be an exquisite and abstract idea of masculine beauty , realised sometimes , perhaps , among angels and military men , but very rarely embodied to gladden the eyes of mortals .
