# text = The old gentleman who had just been lathered , and who was sitting in a melancholy manner with his face turned towards the wall , appeared quite unconscious of this incident , and to be insensible to everything around him in the depth of a reverie -- a very mournful one , to judge from the sighs he occasionally vented -- in which he was absorbed .
