# text = Affected by this example , the proprietor began to clip Miss Kenwigs , the journeyman to scrape the old gentleman , and Newman Noggs to read last Sunday's paper , all three in silence : when Miss Kenwigs uttered a shrill little scream , and Newman , raising his eyes , saw that it had been elicited by the circumstance of the old gentleman turning his head , and disclosing the features of Mr Lillyvick the collector .
