# text = The poor attendant , with her eyes swollen and red with weeping , stood by ; and to her Nicholas appealed in such passionate terms that she opened a side-door , and , supporting her mistress into an adjoining room , beckoned Nicholas to follow them said the young lady returned Nicholas demanded the young lady , with an effort to speak proudly returned Nicholas said Madeline replied Nicholas cried the young lady , striving to repress a shudder , occasioned , as it seemed , even by this slight allusion to Arthur Gride said Madeline cried Nicholas Long before Nicholas ceased to speak , the young lady buried her face in her hands , and gave her tears free way .
