# text = In a voice at first inarticulate with emotion , but gradually recovering strength as she proceeded , she answered him said Nicholas said Madeline , with momentary firmness cried Nicholas said Madeline , hurriedly She was hurrying past Nicholas , when he threw himself before her , and implored her to think , but once again , upon the fate to which she was precipitately hastening said Nicholas , in an agony of supplication she incoherently replied said Nicholas , with the same violent rapidity with which she spoke said Nicholas replied Madeline , not heeding what she said She was gone .
