# text = Raising his eyes , and looking vacantly into this gloom as he made some mental calculation , Arthur Gride suddenly met the fixed gaze of a man shrieked the usurer , starting up and folding his book to his breast said the form , advancing cried the trembling wretch was the inquiry cried Arthur Gride , shading his eyes with his hand said the stranger , coming close up to him cried Gride , somewhat reassured , but still retreating from his visitor was the reply Arthur Gride , venturing to regard his visitor more attentively , and perceiving that he was a young man of good mien and bearing , returned to his seat , and muttering that there were bad characters about , and that this , with former attempts upon his house , had made him nervous , requested his visitor to sit down .
