# text = The unconscious Peg , however , not being able to comprehend the offence of which she had been guilty , he summoned her to hold the light , while he made a tour of the fastenings , and secured the street-door with his own hands muttered Arthur , fastening as he spoke With that , he jocularly tapped Mrs Sliderskew under the chin , and appeared , for the moment , inclined to celebrate the close of his bachelor days by imprinting a kiss on her shrivelled lips .
