# text = And then he added , anxiously said Ralph , with a sneer croaked Arthur said Ralph . ' Nobody will pay you interest for the money , I suppose , between this and twelve o'clock ; will they returned Arthur , leering at Ralph with all the cunning and slyness he could throw into his face said Ralph , suffering his lip to curl into a smile Gride , who had done nothing but grin , and nod , and chatter , during this last speech of Ralph's , answered in the affirmative ; and , producing from his hat a couple of large white favours , pinned one on his breast , and with considerable difficulty induced his friend to do the like .
