# text = Scream succeeded scream ; a heavy pattering of feet succeeded ; and many shrill voices clamouring together were heard to cry cried Nicholas , letting loose all the passion he had restrained till now He burst from the room , and , darting upstairs to the quarter from whence the noise proceeded , forced his way through a crowd of persons who quite filled a small bed-chamber , and found Bray lying on the floor quite dead ; his daughter clinging to the body he cried , looking wildly about him .
