# text = It was not until every preparation was made for Madeline's immediate removal that Ralph broke silence by declaring she should not be taken away cried Nicholas , rising from his knee and confronting them , but still retaining Madeline's lifeless hand in his answered Ralph , hoarsely cried the terrified Gride , catching him by the arm again said Nicholas , extending his disengaged hand in the air said Ralph , in a voice scarcely intelligible said Nicholas said Ralph said Nicholas cried Ralph , foaming at the mouth replied Nicholas cried Ralph , shrinking back Arthur Gride happened to be in the doorway , but whether intentionally or from confusion was not quite apparent .
