# text = However , no doubt she was wrong ; of course she was ; she always was , she couldn't be right , she couldn't be expected to be ; so she had better not expose herself any more ; and to all Kate's conciliations and concessions for an hour ensuing , the good lady gave no other replies than Oh , certainly , why did they ask HER ?, HER opinion was of no consequence , it didn't matter what SHE said , with many other rejoinders of the same class .
