# text = Mrs Nickleby , after stopping a little for consideration , resumed Nicholas laughingly said , as he closed his book , that he was glad to hear it , and observed that his mother seemed deep in their new friend's confidence already said Mrs Nickleby Elated by a look of curiosity from her son , and the consciousness of possessing a great secret , all to herself , Mrs Nickleby went on with great animation Nicholas snuffed the candles , put his hands in his pockets , and , leaning back in his chair , assumed a look of patient suffering and melancholy resignation resumed his mother
