# text = The profound astonishment with which her son regarded her during this long address , gradually increasing as it approached its climax in no way discomposed Mrs Nickleby , but rather exalted her opinion of her own cleverness ; therefore , merely stopping to remark , with much complacency , that she had fully expected him to be surprised , she entered on a vast quantity of circumstantial evidence of a particularly incoherent and perplexing kind ; the upshot of which was , to establish , beyond the possibility of doubt , that Mr Frank Cheeryble had fallen desperately in love with Kate cried Nicholas .
