# text = The iron heart of the grim old clock , undisturbed by all the noise without , still beat heavily within its dusty case ; the tottering presses slunk from the sight , as usual , in their melancholy corners ; the echoes of footsteps returned the same dreary sound ; the long-legged spider paused in his nimble run , and , scared by the sight of men in that his dull domain , hung motionless on the wall , counterfeiting death until they should have passed him by .
