# text = With frantic exclamations such as these , and with many others in which fear , grief , and rage , were strangely blended , the panic - stricken wretch gradually subdued his first loud outcry , until it had softened down into a low despairing moan , chequered now and then by a howl , as , going over such papers as were left in the chest , he discovered some new loss .
