# text = Repressing , with as good a grace as possible , these little familiarities -- for which , there is reason to believe , the black bottle was at least as much to blame as any constitutional infirmity on the part of Mrs Sliderskew -- he protested that he had only been joking : and , in proof of his unimpaired good - humour , that he was ready to examine the deeds at once , if , by so doing , he could afford any satisfaction or relief of mind to his fair friend bawled Squeers , as she rose to fetch them Peg trotted to the door , and after fumbling at the bolt , crept to the other end of the room , and from beneath the coals which filled the bottom of the cupboard , drew forth a small deal box .
