# text = Mr Squeers , who had eagerly followed her every motion , lost no time in obeying this hint : and , throwing back the lid , gazed with rapture on the documents which lay within said Peg , kneeling down on the floor beside him , and staying his impatient hand said Squeers asked Peg roared Squeers cried Peg , with some contempt said Squeers Peg , expressing her acquiescence in this arrangement , Mr Squeers turned the box bottom upwards , and tumbling the contents upon the floor , handed it to her ; the destruction of the box being an extemporary device for engaging her attention , in case it should prove desirable to distract it from his own proceedings said Squeers
