# text = There was the old house too , which they would pass every day , looking up at the tiny window through which the sun used to stream in and wake him on the summer mornings -- they were all summer mornings then -- and climbing up the garden-wall and looking over , Nicholas could see the very rose-bush which had come , a present to Kate , from some little lover , and she had planted with her own hands .
