# text = He could not have closed his eyes five minutes , when he was awakened by a scream , and starting up in that kind of terror which affects a person suddenly roused , saw , to his great astonishment , that his charge had struggled into a sitting posture , and with eyes almost starting from their sockets , cold dew standing on his forehead , and in a fit of trembling which quite convulsed his frame , was calling to him for help said Nicholas , bending over him cried Smike , clinging to him Nicholas followed his eyes , which were directed to some distance behind the chair from which he himself had just risen .
