# text = It instantly roused all his dormant energies ; rekindled in his breast the passions that , for many years , had found an improving home there ; called up all his wrath , hatred , and malice ; restored the sneer to his lip , and the scowl to his brow ; and made him again , in all outward appearance , the same Ralph Nickleby whom so many had bitter cause to remember said Ralph , pausing at the door said brother Charles replied Ralph began brother Charles interrupted Ralph repeated brother Charles mildly , and looking at him with more of pity than reproach said Ralph returned brother Charles : no less mildly than before , but firmly too Ralph glanced keenly at him , but the clear eye and open countenance of the honest old merchant underwent no change of expression , and met his look without reserve said Mr Cheeryble returned Ralph drily
