# text = His wife presented herself ; and , of her , Ralph inquired whether her husband was at home she said sharply asked Ralph said Ralph rejoined Mrs Snawley , taking no further notice of the request said Ralph , passing quietly by said Mr Snawley's better-half , interposing her person , which was a robust one , in the doorway said Ralph , looking fearfully round retorted the dame said Ralph retorted the woman said Ralph , suppressing his passion as well as he could , and clutching her tightly by the wrist replied the woman , violently disengaging herself said Ralph was the answer .
