# text = After a short interval , he returned , and , ushering Ralph into the presence of the two brothers , remained in the room himself said Ralph , pointing out with his finger the man whom he addressed observed brother Charles quietly said Ralph said brother Ned said Ralph with a curl of the lip cried Tim Linkinwater , suddenly growing very red in the face said Charles and Ned together Tim , taking the hint , stifled his indignation as well as he could , and suffered it to escape through his spectacles , with the additional safety-valve of a short hysterical laugh now and then , which seemed to relieve him mightily said Ralph , looking round So coolly and deliberately was this said , that nine men out of ten , ignorant of the circumstances , would have supposed Ralph to be really an injured man .
