# text = Upon this , the pursuers took counsel together , and , coming so near the truth as to arrive at the conclusion that Gride and Ralph , with Squeers for their instrument , were negotiating for the recovery of some of the stolen papers which would not bear the light , and might possibly explain the hints relative to Madeline which Newman had overheard , resolved that Mrs Sliderskew should be taken into custody before she had parted with them : and Squeers too , if anything suspicious could be attached to him .
