# text = Thus they parted , for that time ; but the worst had not come yet Instead of going home , Ralph threw himself into the first street cabriolet he could find , and , directing the driver towards the police-office of the district in which Mr Squeers's misfortunes had occurred , alighted at a short distance from it , and , discharging the man , went the rest of his way thither on foot .
