# text = His running on , in this way , had afforded Ralph an opportunity of recovering his presence of mind , which at once suggested to him the necessity of removing , as far as possible , the schoolmaster's misgivings , and leading him to believe that his safety and best policy lay in the preservation of a rigid silence he said said Squeers , who had looked cunningly at him , with his head stuck on one side , like an old raven added Mr Squeers , with deeper gravity How long Mr Squeers might have declaimed , or how stormy a discussion his declamation might have led to , nobody knows .
