# text = If he had previously sustained his firmness and fortitude , it had been by an effort which had cost him no little pain ; but the warm welcome , the hearty manner , the homely unaffected commiseration , of the good old man , went to his heart , and no inward struggle could prevent his showing it said the benevolent merchant replied Nicholas , clearing his throat replied Mr Cheeryble , who , in the midst of all his comforting , was quite as much taken aback as honest old Tim said Tim exclaimed brother Charles as he shut the door and returned to Nicholas said Nicholas , with some natural hesitation returned brother Charles , looking at him with an anxious countenance said Nicholas replied the old gentleman said Nicholas said brother Charles said Nicholas , firmly said the old man , after a short silence said Mr Cheeryble returned Nicholas , meeting his eye said Mr Cheeryble , apparently very much relieved by this prompt reply said Nicholas replied the old gentleman Upon this head , Nicholas requested permission to add a few words .
