# text = This moral reflection reminding her of the necessity of being peculiarly smart on the occasion , so as to counterbalance Miss La Creevy , and be herself an effectual set-off and atonement , led Mrs Nickleby into a consultation with her daughter relative to certain ribbons , gloves , and trimmings : which , being a complicated question , and one of paramount importance , soon routed the previous one , and put it to flight .
