# text = The great day arriving , the good lady put herself under Kate's hands an hour or so after breakfast , and , dressing by easy stages , completed her toilette in sufficient time to allow of her daughter's making hers , which was very simple , and not very long , though so satisfactory that she had never appeared more charming or looked more lovely .
