# text = Kate was still more affected by the reception : for , knowing that the brothers were acquainted with all that had passed between her and Frank , she felt her position a most delicate and trying one , and was trembling on the arm of Nicholas , when Mr Charles took her in his , and led her to another part of the room he said replied Kate rejoined Kate , gently said the old man , patting her on the head , and speaking as affectionately as if she had been his favourite child said Ned .
