# text = The woman looked , first at Nicholas , and then at Mr Mantalini , as if uncertain on whom to visit this extraordinary behaviour ; but Mr Mantalini happening by ill-luck to thrust his nose from under the bedclothes , in his anxiety to ascertain whether the visitors were gone , she suddenly , and with a dexterity which could only have been acquired by long practice , flung a pretty heavy clothes-basket at him , with so good an aim that he kicked more violently than before , though without venturing to make any effort to disengage his head , which was quite extinguished .
